    // ── ACTION / BATTLE ROYALE ──
    ['title'=>'PUBG MOBILE','pkg'=>'com.tencent.ig','genres'=>['Action','Battle Royale','Multiplayer'],'developer'=>'Level Infinite','rating'=>4.4,'reviews'=>'45M','installs'=>'500M+','installs_raw'=>500000000,'size'=>'800MB','version'=>'3.3.0','updated'=>'May 2025','price'=>'Free','offline'=>false,'icon'=>'https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/JRd05pyBH41qjgsR-4rmHJnOLZdAFXtZjjL8TKWjHjFq_Mf5qlMm_oZ4yYg8Cqjm8M','age'=>'16+','category'=>'Action','playstore'=>'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.tencent.ig','trending'=>98,'featured'=>true,'desc'=>'PUBG MOBILE brings the legendary battle royale experience to Android with unmatched intensity. Drop onto a massive island with 99 other players, scavenge for weapons, drive vehicles, and fight to be the last one standing. With ultra-realistic HD graphics, advanced audio effects, and a constantly evolving meta, every match feels completely unique. Team up with friends in squad mode, communicate with voice chat, and develop strategies to outplay the competition. New seasonal content, maps, and gameplay modes keep the experience fresh and engaging.','editor_review'=>'PUBG MOBILE has redefined what a mobile battle royale can be. The gunplay feels responsive, the maps are sprawling and detailed, and the sheer variety of weapons and vehicles makes every match unpredictable. While it demands significant storage and a stable connection, the payoff is an experience that rivals console-quality shooters. Clan systems and ranked mode give competitive players a reason to keep grinding, and the seasonal updates ensure there is always something new to discover.','how_to_play'=>'Parachute onto the island and immediately search buildings for weapons, armour, and supplies. The playzone shrinks over time, so stay inside the safe zone to avoid taking damage. Use cover wisely — peek from behind walls, use smoke grenades to revive teammates, and communicate enemy positions. Manage your inventory carefully, balancing healing items with ammunition. In the final circle, patience wins — hold position and let enemies make the first mistake.'],

    ['title'=>'Free Fire','pkg'=>'com.dts.freefireth','genres'=>['Action','Battle Royale'],'developer'=>'Garena International','rating'=>4.1,'reviews'=>'75M','installs'=>'1B+','installs_raw'=>1000000000,'size'=>'700MB','version'=>'1.102.1','updated'=>'April 2025','price'=>'Free','offline'=>false,'icon'=>'https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/WWcssdzTBuAHxDMX_HQ2K9TnrdGlSH7cj0EXTp3hfpPDZcVHiP4cFPzuZfYAQgc5sw','age'=>'12+','category'=>'Action','playstore'=>'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.dts.freefireth','trending'=>95,'featured'=>true,'desc'=>'Free Fire is a fast-paced survival shooter designed specifically for mobile play. 50 players land on a remote island with one objective — be the last survivor. Matches last just 10 minutes, making it perfect for quick gaming sessions. Choose from unique characters with special abilities, customise your loadout, and use the environment strategically. Vehicles, ziplines, and supply drops add exciting twists to every round.','editor_review'=>'Free Fire earns its place as one of the most downloaded games ever by delivering a trimmed-down battle royale that works brilliantly on lower-end devices. The character ability system adds a strategic layer missing from competitors, letting you build squad compositions around complementary skills. While the graphics are simpler than some rivals, smooth performance on budget phones makes it accessible to a far wider audience. The frequent collaborations with popular brands and celebrities also keep the community buzzing.','how_to_play'=>'Land quickly, grab the nearest weapon, and eliminate opponents before the zone shrinks. Character abilities can turn the tide — Alok can heal and speed-boost, DJ Alok abilities stack with teammates. Use the crouching and prone systems to minimise your hitbox. Prioritise armour and helmet upgrades early, and save medkits for the late game when healing mid-fight is critical. Vehicles are risky but essential for crossing the open map quickly.'],

    ['title'=>'Call of Duty: Mobile','pkg'=>'com.activision.callofduty.shooter','genres'=>['Action','Multiplayer'],'developer'=>'Activision Publishing','rating'=>4.4,'reviews'=>'20M','installs'=>'100M+','installs_raw'=>100000000,'size'=>'2GB','version'=>'1.0.42','updated'=>'March 2025','price'=>'Free','offline'=>false,'icon'=>'https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=COD+Mobile&background=1a1a2e&color=fff&size=256','age'=>'17+','category'=>'Action','playstore'=>'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.activision.callofduty.shooter','trending'=>93,'featured'=>true,'desc'=>'Call of Duty: Mobile delivers the iconic franchise experience with console-caliber gunplay on Android. Play classic multiplayer modes including Team Deathmatch, Domination, and Search & Destroy across legendary maps. The 100-player Battle Royale mode features a massive map with vehicles, air strikes, and tactical equipment. Operators, weapon blueprints, and a deep progression system give players countless hours of customisation and improvement.','editor_review'=>'COD Mobile is arguably the most fully featured mobile shooter available. The weapon gunsmith system is genuinely deep, letting you build hundreds of weapon variants. Map design is excellent — taken directly from beloved mainline titles — and mode variety is impressive. Performance can be demanding on older phones, but players with mid-range devices and above will enjoy a rock-solid experience. The ranked system is well-balanced, and the battle pass delivers consistent value.','how_to_play'=>'In multiplayer, play to objectives — capturing points and planting bombs scores far more than pure kills. Use the gunsmith to optimise your weapons for range, recoil control, or mobility depending on your playstyle. In BR mode, land in less-contested areas, loot fully before engaging, and call in killstreaks strategically. Communication is key in squad modes — use the quick-comms wheel to relay enemy positions without voice chat.'],

    ['title'=>'Brawl Stars','pkg'=>'com.supercell.brawlstars','genres'=>['Action','Multiplayer','Strategy'],'developer'=>'Supercell','rating'=>4.4,'reviews'=>'12M','installs'=>'100M+','installs_raw'=>100000000,'size'=>'280MB','version'=>'57.261','updated'=>'April 2025','price'=>'Free','offline'=>false,'icon'=>'https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=Brawl+Stars&background=ef4444&color=fff&size=256','age'=>'9+','category'=>'Action','playstore'=>'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.supercell.brawlstars','trending'=>91,'featured'=>false,'desc'=>'Brawl Stars is an action-packed 3v3 multiplayer arena game where you collect and upgrade dozens of unique Brawlers. Compete in fast-paced matches across multiple game modes including Gem Grab, Showdown, Brawl Ball, and Heist. Each Brawler has distinct attacks, super abilities, and gadgets that create exciting gameplay combinations. Regular seasonal updates bring new maps, game modes, and limited-time events.','editor_review'=>'Brawl Stars has found a sweet spot between accessibility and depth. Matches are short enough for casual play but strategically rich enough to reward dedicated players. The roster of Brawlers is impressively diverse — each one genuinely changes how you approach a match. The progression system can feel slow without spending, but the core gameplay loop is compelling enough to keep you playing through it. Season-based content keeps the meta rotating and prevents staleness.','how_to_play'=>'Focus on the objective rather than just getting eliminations. In Gem Grab, collect gems and retreat when you have enough rather than hunting enemies. Each Brawler has a charged super ability — time it carefully for maximum impact. Learn the attack range of your Brawler and position accordingly. Upgrade Star Powers and Gadgets as soon as you unlock them, as they significantly increase your effectiveness.'],

    ['title'=>'Clash of Clans','pkg'=>'com.supercell.clashofclans','genres'=>['Strategy','Multiplayer'],'developer'=>'Supercell','rating'=>4.5,'reviews'=>'65M','installs'=>'500M+','installs_raw'=>500000000,'size'=>'260MB','version'=>'16.253.25','updated'=>'April 2025','price'=>'Free','offline'=>false,'icon'=>'https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/LBB2JfwMJPvDQ9wMqk0LGZ1L16MRH4VsovXyZ1mRnf6pRh6vMtBxJp3h0K6S8bDhPg','age'=>'9+','category'=>'Strategy','playstore'=>'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.supercell.clashofclans','trending'=>88,'featured'=>false,'desc'=>'Clash of Clans is the definitive mobile strategy game. Build and upgrade your village, train an army of Barbarians, Archers, Giants, and Dragons, then raid enemy bases for gold and elixir. Join or create a Clan to participate in Clan Wars, the ultimate test of coordinated strategy where entire communities battle for glory. Clan War Leagues and Clan Games offer additional rewards for dedicated players. The game has evolved continuously over a decade with new hero equipment, troops, and super troops.','editor_review'=>'Over a decade old and still one of the most strategically satisfying mobile games available. Clash of Clans rewards planning — knowing which base layouts are weak to ground attacks versus air attacks is a genuine skill. The Clan Wars system creates a social bond that keeps players loyal long after the novelty wears off. Free-to-play progress is slow but possible, and the game has become more generous with resources over time. If you want a deep, social strategy experience, this remains the gold standard.','how_to_play'=>'Protect your Town Hall — attackers receive fewer stars if your TH is difficult to reach. Farm resources during off-peak hours when defences are weaker. In Clan Wars, scout bases before attacking and communicate with clanmates to maximise star counts. Use spells strategically — Rage spells in kill funnels and Freeze spells on key defences like Eagle Artillery. Upgrade defences in order of threat: Scattershot, Eagle Artillery, and Inferno Towers first.'],

    // ── ARCADE ──
    ['title'=>'Subway Surfers','pkg'=>'com.kiloo.subwaysurf','genres'=>['Arcade','Casual','Offline'],'developer'=>'SYBO Games','rating'=>4.6,'reviews'=>'40M','installs'=>'1B+','installs_raw'=>1000000000,'size'=>'150MB','version'=>'3.35.0','updated'=>'May 2025','price'=>'Free','offline'=>true,'icon'=>'https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/aFWiT2lTa9CYBpyPjfgfNmdzZKX3-lJK3AwhEjFd4iMPiA0eTU0_Q5Yh_GkdUVgW9F','age'=>'4+','category'=>'Arcade','playstore'=>'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.kiloo.subwaysurf','trending'=>92,'featured'=>true,'desc'=>'Subway Surfers is the classic endless runner that has captivated over a billion downloads worldwide. Dash as fast as you can through subway tracks, dodge oncoming trains, leap over barriers, and collect coins to unlock new characters and hoverboards. The game travels around the world with seasonal updates, each bringing a new city theme, characters, and limited-time boards. Power-ups like Jetpacks and Mega Headstarts keep gameplay exciting across thousands of runs.','editor_review'=>'There is a reason Subway Surfers remained the most downloaded game on the planet for years. The controls are perfectly tuned — swipe responsiveness is excellent, the speed escalation feels fair, and the visual variety from city-themed updates keeps it feeling fresh. Hoverboard unlocks add a collectible dimension, and the weekly hunt gives regular players a satisfying goal. It is the definitive pick-up-and-play mobile game and it absolutely deserves its legendary status.','how_to_play'=>'Swipe left and right to switch lanes, swipe up to jump, and swipe down to roll under barriers. Collect coins during runs to unlock new characters and boards from the shop. Activate hoverboards when the inspector catches you for a second chance. Focus on completing mission sets to earn keys, which can be used to continue runs after a crash. Higher score multipliers unlock through mission completions, so finishing objectives should be your primary goal.'],

    ['title'=>'Temple Run 2','pkg'=>'com.imangi.templerun2','genres'=>['Arcade','Offline'],'developer'=>'Imangi Studios','rating'=>4.4,'reviews'=>'8M','installs'=>'500M+','installs_raw'=>500000000,'size'=>'115MB','version'=>'1.108.0','updated'=>'January 2025','price'=>'Free','offline'=>true,'icon'=>'https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=Temple+Run+2&background=f97316&color=fff&size=256','age'=>'4+','category'=>'Arcade','playstore'=>'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.imangi.templerun2','trending'=>72,'featured'=>false,'desc'=>'Temple Run 2 expands on the original formula with more beautiful environments, obstacles, and special powers. Run through stunning jungle cliffs, zip-line between peaks, cross narrow rope bridges, and navigate treacherous mine cart sections, all while being chased by demonic monkeys. Collect coins and gems to unlock new characters and upgrade power-ups. Multiple worlds keep the scenery changing and objectives fresh.','editor_review'=>'Temple Run 2 improved on the original in every measurable way — better graphics, more varied environments, and more satisfying power-up upgrades. The mine cart section remains one of the most tense moments in mobile gaming. Character unlocks give collectors something to chase, and the objective system ensures there is always a short-term goal driving each run. It is not the most innovative endless runner anymore, but it remains one of the most polished.','how_to_play'=>'Tilt your device to guide your runner left and right, swipe to turn at corners, jump over roots and barriers, and slide under low obstacles. Collect red gems and gold coins to power up and unlock characters. Prioritise upgrading Coin Magnet and Score Multiplier first, as these snowball your earnings fastest. Watch for the tilt-to-dodge sections in narrow cliff paths and react early rather than last-second.'],

    ['title'=>'Geometry Dash','pkg'=>'com.robtopx.geometryjump','genres'=>['Arcade','Offline'],'developer'=>'RobTop Games AB','rating'=>4.6,'reviews'=>'2M','installs'=>'50M+','installs_raw'=>50000000,'size'=>'80MB','version'=>'2.2.14','updated'=>'March 2025','price'=>'$1.99','offline'=>true,'icon'=>'https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=Geometry+Dash&background=f97316&color=fff&size=256','age'=>'4+','category'=>'Arcade','playstore'=>'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.robtopx.geometryjump','trending'=>80,'featured'=>false,'desc'=>'Geometry Dash is a rhythm-based platformer where you tap to jump, fly, and flip your way through dangerous passages and spike-filled obstacles. With 21 official levels and thousands of user-created levels available online, the replayability is virtually endless. The pulsing electronic soundtrack syncs perfectly with the gameplay, creating a uniquely satisfying experience when you clear a difficult section. The level editor lets you create and share your own challenges with the global community.','editor_review'=>'Geometry Dash is one of the few mobile games that is genuinely hard by design — and it is better for it. The rhythm-action loop of failing, memorising patterns, and eventually clearing a level is intensely satisfying. The community level ecosystem has extended the games lifespan far beyond what the base content alone could offer, with some community creations being more impressive than the official stages. The one-time paid price also means no energy systems or pay-to-win mechanics interrupting your flow.','how_to_play'=>'Tap the screen to jump and hold for extended jumping. The game auto-scrolls so you must focus on tapping with precise timing synced to the music. In ship mode, hold to ascend and release to descend. Each level requires memorisation — expect to die hundreds of times on harder stages. Practice Mode lets you place checkpoints and rehearse difficult sections without running the full level each time. Start with the easier levels and build muscle memory before attempting Demon-rated community maps.'],

    ['title'=>'Fruit Ninja Classic','pkg'=>'com.halfbrick.fruitninja','genres'=>['Arcade','Casual','Offline'],'developer'=>'Halfbrick Studios','rating'=>4.3,'reviews'=>'5M','installs'=>'100M+','installs_raw'=>100000000,'size'=>'65MB','version'=>'3.3.9','updated'=>'November 2024','price'=>'Free','offline'=>true,'icon'=>'https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=Fruit+Ninja&background=ef4444&color=fff&size=256','age'=>'4+','category'=>'Arcade','playstore'=>'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.halfbrick.fruitninja','trending'=>65,'featured'=>false,'desc'=>'Slice fruit, dodge bombs, and chase the highest score in Fruit Ninja, the beloved touchscreen classic. Swipe your blade across the screen to cut through watermelons, pineapples, and coconuts while avoiding deadly bombs. Three unique game modes — Classic, Arcade, and Zen — offer different challenges and scoring strategies. Unlock colourful blades and dojo backgrounds, and compete against friends on global leaderboards.','editor_review'=>'Fruit Ninja invented a genre of its own and still delivers the cleanest implementation of it. The physics of fruit splitting apart feels genuinely satisfying even after years of play. Arcade Mode with its freeze, frenzy, and double score bananas is the most strategic of the modes, rewarding players who maximise their combos. While the game has not evolved dramatically, its simplicity is also its strength — it remains one of the most intuitive touchscreen experiences ever made.','how_to_play'=>'Swipe quickly across clusters of fruit to score combo bonuses — the more fruit you cut in one stroke, the higher your score multiplier. In Classic Mode, three missed fruit means game over, so prioritise not missing over chasing combos. Never swipe through bombs — they end your game instantly. In Arcade Mode, activate starfruit by cutting five fruit in one swipe to trigger score multipliers that can dramatically boost your total.'],

    ['title'=>'Angry Birds 2','pkg'=>'com.rovio.baba','genres'=>['Arcade','Puzzle','Casual'],'developer'=>'Rovio Entertainment','rating'=>4.0,'reviews'=>'9M','installs'=>'100M+','installs_raw'=>100000000,'size'=>'300MB','version'=>'3.23.1','updated'=>'April 2025','price'=>'Free','offline'=>false,'icon'=>'https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=Angry+Birds+2&background=ef4444&color=fff&size=256','age'=>'3+','category'=>'Arcade','playstore'=>'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.rovio.baba','trending'=>68,'featured'=>false,'desc'=>'Angry Birds 2 brings the iconic slingshot physics puzzler into a bold new era with multi-stage levels, new birds, and spectacular destruction. Sling your flock of feathered fighters at the pigs defences across hundreds of handcrafted levels. The Mighty Eagle Boss battles challenge even veteran players. Daily events, Clans, and the Arena PvP mode add competitive and social layers to the classic formula.','editor_review'=>'Angry Birds 2 is a genuine evolution of the original concept. The card-based bird selection system adds meaningful strategy — knowing which bird to use on which structure is more nuanced than it appears. Multi-stage levels make each encounter feel more like a proper puzzle. The energy system is the biggest criticism, as it can limit how much you play in one session. But when you are in the flow, demolishing pig fortresses with satisfyingly chunky physics remains endlessly enjoyable.','how_to_play'=>'Study the structure before you shoot — look for weak points where one bird can topple an entire section. Red birds deal direct damage, Blues split for multiple targets, Yellow Bird accelerates mid-flight for precision hits, and Black Bird explodes on impact. Choose your bird cards strategically based on the materials in the level. Stone requires Black or Yellow Bird; wood and glass fall easily to Red or Blue.'],

    // ── PUZZLE ──
    ['title'=>'Candy Crush Saga','pkg'=>'com.king.candycrushsaga','genres'=>['Puzzle','Casual','Offline'],'developer'=>'King','rating'=>4.6,'reviews'=>'35M','installs'=>'1B+','installs_raw'=>1000000000,'size'=>'90MB','version'=>'1.280.0','updated'=>'April 2025','price'=>'Free','offline'=>true,'icon'=>'https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/DJh_0b8U9kpDrR14rXCHqAXlOdJmJvH-OvLbA2jQ9TT3BrNsPz9UeD-Lkm-UiGCb0A','age'=>'3+','category'=>'Puzzle','playstore'=>'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.king.candycrushsaga','trending'=>88,'featured'=>false,'desc'=>'Candy Crush Saga is the world-famous match-3 puzzle game with over one trillion levels played globally. Match colourful candies to clear objectives, create special candies through clever combinations, and blast your way through thousands of increasingly challenging levels. The Candy Kingdom stretches across mountains, forests, and magical lands, each with a distinct aesthetic. Connect with friends to compare scores and send lives on your journey through the sugary adventure.','editor_review'=>'There is an undeniable reason Candy Crush Saga became a cultural phenomenon — the satisfaction of creating a Colour Bomb and clearing an entire board is genuinely compelling. The difficulty curve is well designed, gradually introducing new mechanics and obstacles that keep experienced players engaged. The energy system can frustrate during difficult levels, but patient players who take breaks rather than buying boosters will find the game surprisingly fair. Over 5000 levels means you will be matching candies for a very long time.','how_to_play'=>'Always look for moves that create special candies before making ordinary matches. Striped candies clear rows or columns, wrapped candies explode twice, and Colour Bombs remove all candies of one colour. Combining two special candies creates spectacular chain reactions — a Striped plus Colour Bomb clears entire rows and columns simultaneously. Save your boosters for levels with tight move limits and study the objective carefully before making your first move.'],

    ['title'=>'Wordscapes','pkg'=>'com.peoplefun.wordcross','genres'=>['Puzzle','Word','Offline'],'developer'=>'PeopleFun','rating'=>4.8,'reviews'=>'5M','installs'=>'50M+','installs_raw'=>50000000,'size'=>'55MB','version'=>'1.95.0','updated'=>'March 2025','price'=>'Free','offline'=>true,'icon'=>'https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=Wordscapes&background=eab308&color=fff&size=256','age'=>'4+','category'=>'Puzzle','playstore'=>'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.peoplefun.wordcross','trending'=>74,'featured'=>false,'desc'=>'Wordscapes blends the best of word search and crossword puzzles into a beautifully relaxing experience. Swipe across letters in a circular wheel to form words that fill a crossword grid. Each solved puzzle reveals a stunning nature background — from misty forests and mountain peaks to tropical beaches and snowy valleys. With thousands of levels across multiple themed worlds, Wordscapes offers a genuinely meditative and intellectually stimulating experience.','editor_review'=>'Wordscapes stands out in a crowded word game market by making every puzzle feel like an accomplishment. The circular letter wheel interface is intuitive, and the natural scenery backgrounds give the game a calming atmosphere perfect for unwinding. Bonus words hidden beyond the required answers reward players with a larger vocabulary. The level design is creative — each puzzle uses a unique letter set that often leads to surprising word discoveries.','how_to_play'=>'Swipe across the letter wheel to spell words. Fill all the crossword blanks to complete a level and unlock the next. Try every combination of letters you can think of — bonus words not in the crossword still earn coins. If you are stuck, use coin hints to reveal one letter at a time. Longer words often appear diagonally in the crossword, so look for unusual placements when stuck.'],

    ['title'=>'Block Blast!','pkg'=>'com.block.juggle','genres'=>['Puzzle','Casual','Offline'],'developer'=>'Hungry Studio','rating'=>4.3,'reviews'=>'3M','installs'=>'50M+','installs_raw'=>50000000,'size'=>'120MB','version'=>'5.5.2','updated'=>'February 2025','price'=>'Free','offline'=>true,'icon'=>'https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=Block+Blast&background=eab308&color=fff&size=256','age'=>'3+','category'=>'Puzzle','playstore'=>'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.block.juggle','trending'=>78,'featured'=>false,'desc'=>'Block Blast is the addictive block puzzle game that challenges you to place Tetris-like pieces on a board and clear lines before space runs out. Unlike traditional Tetris, pieces do not fall automatically — you choose where to place each block, giving you time to plan ahead. Clear multiple lines simultaneously to score high and keep the board clear as long as possible. Simple to learn but genuinely difficult to master, Block Blast is perfect for both quick sessions and extended play.','editor_review'=>'Block Blast has earned its massive player base through elegant simplicity. The slow-down from removing the falling mechanic makes it more strategic than Tetris while remaining immediately accessible. Planning three or four moves ahead creates satisfying chain clears that reward thoughtful players. The absence of a timer means you can approach it as a relaxing puzzle rather than a frantic action game. A near-perfect idle puzzle experience.','how_to_play'=>'Drag and drop the three available blocks onto the 8x8 grid to clear full rows or columns. Plan your placements to leave space for future blocks — do not fill the board randomly. Prioritise clearing two or more lines simultaneously for higher scores. If all three blocks cannot fit on the board, the game ends, so always think several moves ahead.'],

    ['title'=>'Brain Out','pkg'=>'com.mind.quiz.tricky.puzzle','genres'=>['Puzzle','Casual'],'developer'=>'Focus Apps','rating'=>4.2,'reviews'=>'4M','installs'=>'100M+','installs_raw'=>100000000,'size'=>'90MB','version'=>'1.7.1','updated'=>'September 2024','price'=>'Free','offline'=>true,'icon'=>'https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=Brain+Out&background=eab308&color=fff&size=256','age'=>'4+','category'=>'Puzzle','playstore'=>'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.mind.quiz.tricky.puzzle','trending'=>69,'featured'=>false,'desc'=>'Brain Out is a collection of tricky riddles and mind-bending puzzles that test your creativity and lateral thinking. The answers are never what you expect — the game constantly subverts conventional logic and rewards players who think outside the box. From counting objects hidden in plain sight to using physics in unexpected ways, Brain Out challenges your perception and problem-solving in over 290 levels.','editor_review'=>'Brain Out is at its best when it completely catches you off guard with an answer that seems absurd until you have that satisfying moment of realisation. The trick-question format creates genuine moments of laughter and frustration in equal measure. Some puzzles lean on phone-specific features like tilting or shaking, which is a clever use of mobile hardware. The hint system is generous enough that frustrating levels do not become deal-breakers.','how_to_play'=>'Think creatively and resist the obvious answer. Many puzzles require interacting with elements outside the puzzle frame, using multiple fingers simultaneously, or applying physics in unexpected ways. If stuck, examine everything on screen, including the question text itself, as it sometimes contains hidden clues. The hint button costs a fixed number of hints per day, so save them for genuinely impossible puzzles.'],

    // ── RPG ──
    ['title'=>'Genshin Impact','pkg'=>'com.miHoYo.GenshinImpact','genres'=>['RPG','Adventure','Open World'],'developer'=>'COGNOSPHERE PTE. LTD.','rating'=>4.3,'reviews'=>'5M','installs'=>'50M+','installs_raw'=>50000000,'size'=>'16GB','version'=>'5.5.0','updated'=>'May 2025','price'=>'Free','offline'=>false,'icon'=>'https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/JUaHX-0kBHGMhilDJ2P6lfpJwGpAhXTuNHWlpbGwcfSHKhzOdOdE6OMUVJ0hDalH_A','age'=>'12+','category'=>'RPG','playstore'=>'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.miHoYo.GenshinImpact','trending'=>99,'featured'=>true,'desc'=>'Genshin Impact is a breathtaking open-world action RPG set in the world of Teyvat, a land governed by seven elemental gods. Play as the Traveller, searching for your lost sibling across stunning, highly detailed regions. Assemble a team of up to four playable characters, each with unique elemental abilities, and combine them to trigger powerful elemental reactions. Explore vast landscapes, solve environmental puzzles, conquer challenging Domains and spiral Abyss floors, and engage in a deeply written story spanning dozens of hours.','editor_review'=>'Genshin Impact raised the bar for what is possible on mobile. The world design is breathtaking — every region feels distinct, thoughtfully constructed, and full of secrets waiting to be uncovered. The elemental reaction combat system is genuinely innovative, rewarding players who understand how Pyro, Hydro, Electro, and other elements interact. The gacha monetisation is the games most significant flaw, as acquiring top-tier characters requires substantial luck or spending. But for players content with what is freely available, the sheer volume of content is extraordinary.','how_to_play'=>'Explore the world to earn Adventure Rank and unlock Resin for stamina-based content. Build a team around elemental synergies — pair Hydro and Electro characters to trigger Electro-Charged, or use Pyro and Cryo for Melt reactions. Prioritise artifact farming at higher Adventure Ranks, as artifacts ultimately determine a character\'s power more than weapon level. Complete Archon Quests for the main story, then World Quests for lore and Primogems. Spiral Abyss rewards challenge consistent players with a steady supply of premium currency.'],

    ['title'=>'AFK Arena','pkg'=>'com.lilithgame.hgame.gp','genres'=>['RPG','Strategy','Casual'],'developer'=>'Farlight Games','rating'=>4.2,'reviews'=>'4M','installs'=>'50M+','installs_raw'=>50000000,'size'=>'480MB','version'=>'1.145.01','updated'=>'March 2025','price'=>'Free','offline'=>false,'icon'=>'https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=AFK+Arena&background=8b5cf6&color=fff&size=256','age'=>'12+','category'=>'RPG','playstore'=>'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.lilithgame.hgame.gp','trending'=>76,'featured'=>false,'desc'=>'AFK Arena is an idle RPG that respects your time by letting your heroes battle and collect rewards even when you are offline. Choose from over 100 unique heroes across five factions, each with distinctive abilities and lore. Form synergistic teams, place heroes strategically on the battlefield, and watch them auto-battle their way to victory. Regular guild wars, limited-time events, and a sprawling campaign story keep the experience constantly evolving.','editor_review'=>'AFK Arena is the best argument for the idle RPG genre because it genuinely delivers on its promise of progress without demanding constant attention. The art style is gorgeous — each hero is beautifully illustrated with fluid animations. Team building is more strategic than it appears, with faction bonuses and formation positioning mattering significantly. The gacha rates are transparent and relatively fair, and the game regularly gives away premium currency through events. A great companion game for commuters and busy schedules.','how_to_play'=>'Log in twice daily to collect your AFK rewards and complete daily quests. Place tanks at the front of your formation and damage dealers behind them. Faction bonuses activate when you field heroes of the same type — build around a core faction for a significant power boost. Spend Diamonds on faction scrolls rather than fast summoning for better value. Focus on ascending a few key heroes to elite+ tier rather than spreading resources across many characters.'],

    ['title'=>'RAID: Shadow Legends','pkg'=>'com.plarium.raidlegends','genres'=>['RPG','Strategy'],'developer'=>'Plarium Global Ltd','rating'=>4.1,'reviews'=>'2M','installs'=>'50M+','installs_raw'=>50000000,'size'=>'2.5GB','version'=>'9.50.0','updated'=>'April 2025','price'=>'Free','offline'=>false,'icon'=>'https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=RAID&background=8b5cf6&color=fff&size=256','age'=>'12+','category'=>'RPG','playstore'=>'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.plarium.raidlegends','trending'=>72,'featured'=>false,'desc'=>'RAID: Shadow Legends is a visually stunning turn-based RPG with over 700 unique champions to collect and develop. Build your roster from 16 distinct factions, each with their own lore and visual identity. Explore the dark fantasy world of Teleria through a campaign spanning 12 locations, then test your power in the Clan Boss, Dungeons, Arena PvP, and Faction Wars. Strategic team composition and champion skill mastery are at the heart of the game.','editor_review'=>'RAID delivers production values that are genuinely impressive for a mobile game — champion animations and voice acting set a high standard for the genre. The depth of champion customisation through masteries and skill upgrades is substantial and rewards dedicated research. However, the game is aggressively monetised, and reaching competitive benchmarks without spending is a multi-year project. Players who enjoy min-maxing team compositions and are patient with progression will find a genuinely deep experience here.','how_to_play'=>'Focus on completing the campaign to unlock the Arena and other content. Build a team with at least one healer, one crowd control champion, and two damage dealers. Prioritise farming Greater Potions from Dungeons to upgrade champion skills. The Clan Boss fight rewards consistent daily attempts — use champions with Decrease Attack and Heal Reduction skills to extend the encounter. Masteries take time to unlock but significantly amplify champion performance.'],

    ['title'=>'Soul Knight','pkg'=>'com.ChillyRoom.DungeonShooter','genres'=>['RPG','Arcade','Offline'],'developer'=>'ChillyRoom','rating'=>4.6,'reviews'=>'1M','installs'=>'10M+','installs_raw'=>10000000,'size'=>'180MB','version'=>'6.0.0','updated'=>'March 2025','price'=>'Free','offline'=>true,'icon'=>'https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=Soul+Knight&background=8b5cf6&color=fff&size=256','age'=>'9+','category'=>'RPG','playstore'=>'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.ChillyRoom.DungeonShooter','trending'=>71,'featured'=>false,'desc'=>'Soul Knight is a pixel-art dungeon crawler where you fight through endless waves of enemies using a vast arsenal of procedurally generated weapons. Choose from 20+ unique characters, each with a special ability that fundamentally changes your playstyle. Every run generates a new dungeon layout with different weapons, enemies, and boss encounters. With over 400 weapons, dozens of skills, and roguelike progression, Soul Knight offers extraordinary replay value at no cost.','editor_review'=>'Soul Knight is a remarkable achievement in mobile game design. The sheer variety of weapons — from crossbows and energy swords to toilet plungers and alien relics — means every run feels different. Character abilities are meaningfully distinct, encouraging multiple playthroughs to master each one. The pixel art aesthetic is charming and the cooperative mode makes it a great game to play with friends locally. For an offline RPG with limitless replayability, Soul Knight is among the very best.','how_to_play'=>'Use the left joystick to move and tap the right side of the screen to attack in the direction you are facing. Manage your MP carefully as special attacks cost mana. Prioritise weapons that match your character\'s special ability — the Engineer synergises with turrets, the Rogue benefits from high attack speed weapons. Pick up heart items immediately as they do not persist between rooms. Boss rooms are telegraphed by larger doors — heal and stock up before entering.'],

    // ── RACING ──
    ['title'=>'Asphalt 9: Legends','pkg'=>'com.gameloft.android.ANMP.GloftA9HM','genres'=>['Racing','Action'],'developer'=>'Gameloft SE','rating'=>4.5,'reviews'=>'7M','installs'=>'100M+','installs_raw'=>100000000,'size'=>'2.5GB','version'=>'4.9.0','updated'=>'April 2025','price'=>'Free','offline'=>false,'icon'=>'https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=Asphalt+9&background=3b82f6&color=fff&size=256','age'=>'3+','category'=>'Racing','playstore'=>'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.gameloft.android.ANMP.GloftA9HM','trending'=>86,'featured'=>false,'desc'=>'Asphalt 9: Legends features the most prestigious roster of hypercars ever assembled in a mobile racing game — Ferrari, Lamborghini, Porsche, and Bugatti among them. Race across stunning locations from the Swiss Alps to the streets of San Francisco, pulling off insane stunts and nitro-boosted overtakes. The TouchDrive control system makes it accessible to newcomers while the full manual controls reward skilled players with faster times. Over 800 events across 70 seasons keep the competition fierce.','editor_review'=>'Visually, Asphalt 9 is in a class of its own for mobile racing — the car models are stunning and environmental detail is remarkable at maximum settings. The arcade physics encourage aggressive, stunt-heavy driving that is exhilarating in a way that simulation racing cannot replicate. The car collection system drives long-term engagement effectively. The main frustration is the free-to-play structure, which gates top cars behind significant grinding or spending, but the base experience is spectacular regardless.','how_to_play'=>'Use nitro aggressively — drifting around corners fills your nitro bar, and double-tapping triggers a Nitro Shockwave that lets you crash through rival cars. Position yourself on the outside of corners then swing inward for the racing line. In TouchDrive mode the car steers automatically, so focus on timing your drifts and nitro boosts. In multiplayer, focus on defence in the early race, then push hard with saved nitro in the final stretch.'],

    ['title'=>'Hill Climb Racing 2','pkg'=>'com.fingersoft.hcr2','genres'=>['Racing','Casual','Offline'],'developer'=>'Fingersoft','rating'=>4.4,'reviews'=>'6M','installs'=>'100M+','installs_raw'=>100000000,'size'=>'300MB','version'=>'1.65.0','updated'=>'March 2025','price'=>'Free','offline'=>true,'icon'=>'https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=HCR2&background=3b82f6&color=fff&size=256','age'=>'4+','category'=>'Racing','playstore'=>'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.fingersoft.hcr2','trending'=>77,'featured'=>false,'desc'=>'Hill Climb Racing 2 builds on the physics-driven fun of the original with online multiplayer, deeper vehicle customisation, and stunning new environments. Race up impossible hills, leap over giant jumps, and collect coins to upgrade your vehicle\'s engine, tyres, and suspension. A massive roster of vehicles — from buggies and motorcycles to rocket-powered contraptions — offers wildly different handling characteristics. Real-time multiplayer races add a competitive dimension to the classic hill-climbing formula.','editor_review'=>'The joy of Hill Climb Racing 2 comes from its gloriously chaotic physics. Watching your driver\'s head slam into the dashboard during a failed landing never gets old. The upgrade system provides meaningful progression, and vehicle variety ensures there is always a new handling model to master. Multiplayer is the standout addition — racing against real opponents adds genuine excitement to what was previously a solo experience. A perfect example of a sequel done right.','how_to_play'=>'Balance acceleration and braking to maintain forward momentum without flipping. Lean your vehicle backward on steep ascents to prevent the nose from diving, and forward when descending to avoid flipping backwards. Collect coins during runs to fund upgrades — tyres and suspension are often more impactful than engine upgrades on technical tracks. In multiplayer, learn which vehicle class dominates each track and equip items strategically to interfere with opponents.'],

    ['title'=>'Real Racing 3','pkg'=>'com.ea.games.r3_na','genres'=>['Racing','Simulation'],'developer'=>'Electronic Arts','rating'=>4.1,'reviews'=>'4M','installs'=>'100M+','installs_raw'=>100000000,'size'=>'1.2GB','version'=>'12.3.1','updated'=>'April 2025','price'=>'Free','offline'=>false,'icon'=>'https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=Real+Racing+3&background=3b82f6&color=fff&size=256','age'=>'4+','category'=>'Racing','playstore'=>'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.ea.games.r3_na','trending'=>70,'featured'=>false,'desc'=>'Real Racing 3 delivers authentic motorsport on Android with officially licensed tracks, real cars, and a time-shifted multiplayer system that lets you race against recorded ghost data of real players. With over 300 cars from leading manufacturers and 40+ licensed tracks including the Nurburgring and Circuit de la Sarthe, it is the most comprehensive racing simulation on mobile. Damage modelling, real-time reflections, and detailed cockpit views create an unmatched level of racing authenticity.','editor_review'=>'Real Racing 3 is the benchmark for mobile racing simulation. The car roster is extraordinary, the tracks are faithful reproductions of their real-world counterparts, and the handling model is sophisticated enough to feel genuinely rewarding to master. The time-shifted multiplayer is clever — it eliminates lag issues while still providing the challenge of racing against real player data. The pay-to-repair system remains the games most criticised element, but patient players who do not abuse their cars will find it manageable.','how_to_play'=>'Use the braking assistance to identify correct braking points, then gradually reduce assistance as you build track knowledge. Maintain the racing line — the inside of a corner entry that opens to the outside on exit. Avoid contact with other cars as repair costs reduce earnings. Upgrade cars strategically for specific events; sometimes a slightly slower car with better handling attributes outperforms a faster but harder to control alternative.'],

    ['title'=>'Traffic Rider','pkg'=>'com.skgames.trafficrider','genres'=>['Racing','Casual','Offline'],'developer'=>'SKGames','rating'=>4.5,'reviews'=>'5M','installs'=>'100M+','installs_raw'=>100000000,'size'=>'70MB','version'=>'1.99.9','updated'=>'January 2025','price'=>'Free','offline'=>true,'icon'=>'https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=Traffic+Rider&background=3b82f6&color=fff&size=256','age'=>'3+','category'=>'Racing','playstore'=>'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.skgames.trafficrider','trending'=>68,'featured'=>false,'desc'=>'Traffic Rider places you on a motorcycle weaving through heavy freeway traffic at high speed. The first-person perspective creates a visceral sense of speed that is genuinely thrilling. Career Mode features 70+ missions across different times of day and weather conditions, while Endless Mode challenges you to survive as long as possible. Unlock and upgrade a diverse fleet of motorcycles, from classic cruisers to high-performance sport bikes.','editor_review'=>'Traffic Rider proves that a simple concept executed flawlessly can create a deeply satisfying game. The first-person perspective immediately establishes tension that a third-person racer cannot replicate, and the realistic engine sounds make each bike feel authentically different. The close-pass bonus system rewards nerve and encourages increasingly daring manoeuvres. Bike handling feels weighty and responsive, and the 70 career missions provide a surprising amount of structured content.','how_to_play'=>'Tilt your device or use the on-screen buttons to steer. Accelerate continuously and score bonus points for overtaking close to other vehicles. In career missions read the objective carefully — some require reaching a destination, others mandate a specific number of overtakes or completing the route within a time limit. Upgrade top speed and acceleration first, then handling for sharper responses in dense traffic.'],

    // ── SPORTS ──
    ['title'=>'EA SPORTS FC Mobile','pkg'=>'com.ea.gp.fifamobile','genres'=>['Sports','Simulation','Multiplayer'],'developer'=>'ELECTRONIC ARTS','rating'=>4.3,'reviews'=>'10M','installs'=>'100M+','installs_raw'=>100000000,'size'=>'420MB','version'=>'21.1.02','updated'=>'April 2025','price'=>'Free','offline'=>false,'icon'=>'https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=FC+Mobile&background=10b981&color=fff&size=256','age'=>'4+','category'=>'Sports','playstore'=>'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.ea.gp.fifamobile','trending'=>91,'featured'=>true,'desc'=>'EA SPORTS FC Mobile is the premier football experience on Android, featuring authentic players, clubs, and leagues from around the world. Build your Ultimate Team by collecting player cards, then compete in real-time Head to Head matches against opponents globally. Manager Mode lets you develop a club over multiple seasons, signing players and tactical progression. Regular live events mirror real-world football with special player cards themed around actual tournaments and transfers.','editor_review'=>'FC Mobile captures the essence of football management and play better than any mobile competitor. The player card system is deeply addictive, and the ebb and flow of Head to Head matches creates genuine drama. The graphics have improved dramatically in recent versions — player likenesses on star cards are remarkably accurate. The stamina system limits how many H2H matches you can play at once, which can frustrate during hot streaks, but overall the free-to-play balance is reasonable compared to other sports games.','how_to_play'=>'Tap on a player to select them, then tap another to pass. Use the sprint button to accelerate on the flanks and pull back for skill moves before shooting. In defence, tap the opposing ball carrier to tackle and hold the button to second-tackle. Build your team chemistry by using players from the same league, nation, or club for significant statistical bonuses. Prioritise upgrading your goalkeeper and centre-backs as defensive solidity determines whether you win tight matches.'],

    ['title'=>'NBA 2K Mobile Basketball','pkg'=>'com.catdaddy.nba2k','genres'=>['Sports','Simulation'],'developer'=>'2K','rating'=>4.0,'reviews'=>'2M','installs'=>'10M+','installs_raw'=>10000000,'size'=>'2.5GB','version'=>'8.3.8','updated'=>'February 2025','price'=>'Free','offline'=>false,'icon'=>'https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=NBA+2K&background=10b981&color=fff&size=256','age'=>'4+','category'=>'Sports','playstore'=>'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.catdaddy.nba2k','trending'=>72,'featured'=>false,'desc'=>'NBA 2K Mobile brings authentic basketball to Android with real NBA player likenesses, licensed courts, and broadcast-quality presentation. Build a dream team from past and present NBA superstars and compete in 5v5 gameplay with fluid dribble controls, shot timing mechanics, and playbook strategies. Dominate the Season Mode, compete in 3v3 Blacktop games, or challenge rivals in real-time PvP matches.','editor_review'=>'NBA 2K Mobile is the most visually authentic basketball game available on mobile. Player animations are remarkably true to their real-world counterparts, and the shooting rhythm system creates a skill curve that separates good players from great ones. The card collection system will be familiar to fans of the console franchise, and team building has genuine depth. The game demands significant storage space, but for basketball fans wanting the most faithful mobile representation, it delivers.','how_to_play'=>'Time your shot release with the on-screen indicator for perfect release bonuses. In defence, watch for the ball handler\'s animation to anticipate steal opportunities. Building chemistry through matching players by team or era creates stat bonuses that significantly impact competitiveness. In PvP, study your opponent\'s deck before matches to identify their key players and contest their preferred shot locations.'],

    ['title'=>'8 Ball Pool','pkg'=>'com.miniclip.eightballpool','genres'=>['Sports','Multiplayer'],'developer'=>'Miniclip','rating'=>4.5,'reviews'=>'25M','installs'=>'500M+','installs_raw'=>500000000,'size'=>'65MB','version'=>'5.19.1','updated'=>'April 2025','price'=>'Free','offline'=>false,'icon'=>'https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=8+Ball+Pool&background=10b981&color=fff&size=256','age'=>'4+','category'=>'Sports','playstore'=>'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.miniclip.eightballpool','trending'=>85,'featured'=>false,'desc'=>'8 Ball Pool is the world\'s most popular online pool game with hundreds of millions of players across the globe. Challenge friends or match up with strangers in 1-vs-1 pool matches or enter competitive tournaments. Win Coins to stake in higher-value tables, unlock unique cue designs, and climb the global leaderboard. The game accurately simulates billiard physics, rewarding players who understand spin, angle, and cue ball positioning.','editor_review'=>'8 Ball Pool nails the social pick-up-and-play formula. The betting system creates genuine stakes even without real money involved — losing a hard-earned coin stack is painful, and winning creates a satisfying rush. Physics are accurate enough to reward real pool skill, making practice genuinely transferable knowledge. The table progression from beginner to Sydney and beyond creates a clear status hierarchy that drives long-term engagement. Essential for competitive mobile players.','how_to_play'=>'Plan two shots ahead — think about where the cue ball will end up after each shot, not just sinking the current ball. Apply spin using the cue ball indicator to control your position for the next shot. In the 8-ball rule, avoid potting the 8-ball until all your balls are cleared. Shot clock management matters in competitive games — never rush into shots but do not take too long either as the clock penalty is steep.'],

    // ── STRATEGY ──
    ['title'=>'Clash Royale','pkg'=>'com.supercell.clashroyale','genres'=>['Strategy','Action','Multiplayer'],'developer'=>'Supercell','rating'=>4.2,'reviews'=>'15M','installs'=>'500M+','installs_raw'=>500000000,'size'=>'170MB','version'=>'62.81','updated'=>'May 2025','price'=>'Free','offline'=>false,'icon'=>'https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=Clash+Royale&background=6366f1&color=fff&size=256','age'=>'9+','category'=>'Strategy','playstore'=>'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.supercell.clashroyale','trending'=>89,'featured'=>false,'desc'=>'Clash Royale is a real-time strategy card game where you deploy troops, buildings, and spells from your hand to destroy the enemy\'s towers. Build and optimise a deck of up to eight cards from the ever-expanding roster, then climb the ladder of Arenas through increasingly fierce competition. Clan Wars, Path of Legends, and limited-time Special Events provide a constantly rotating competitive landscape that rewards deck-building creativity and tactical adaptation.','editor_review'=>'Clash Royale is one of the most cleverly designed mobile games ever made. The two-minute match format creates intense decision-making moments — every Elixir point is precious and misusing it is immediately punished. Card synergies are deep enough that true mastery requires hundreds of hours, yet the basic premise is understandable in seconds. The seasonal meta shifts force constant deck adaptation, which keeps the competitive experience from ever feeling stale. A true landmark of mobile game design.','how_to_play'=>'Count your opponent\'s Elixir spending and make offensive pushes when they have just used expensive cards. Never lead with your win condition card — build a push around it with support troops. The Bridge Spam strategy rewards aggressive play in double Elixir; defensive siege strategies reward patient play in single Elixir time. Miner and Goblin Barrel are low-cost cycle options that maintain pressure without overcommitting Elixir.'],

    ['title'=>'Rise of Kingdoms','pkg'=>'com.lilithgame.roc.gplay','genres'=>['Strategy','Multiplayer'],'developer'=>'Lilith Games','rating'=>4.3,'reviews'=>'3M','installs'=>'50M+','installs_raw'=>50000000,'size'=>'1.5GB','version'=>'1.0.89','updated'=>'April 2025','price'=>'Free','offline'=>false,'icon'=>'https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=Rise+of+Kingdoms&background=6366f1&color=fff&size=256','age'=>'12+','category'=>'Strategy','playstore'=>'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.lilithgame.roc.gplay','trending'=>77,'featured'=>false,'desc'=>'Rise of Kingdoms is a massive multiplayer real-time strategy game set across a seamless world map shared by all players. Choose from 13 historical civilisations — each with unique bonuses — and lead your empire from a small settlement to a dominant power. Command legendary Commanders like Julius Caesar, Joan of Arc, and Genghis Khan in battles across a gorgeous realistically proportioned world. Alliance warfare, Barbarian Fort rallies, and Kingdom vs Kingdom events create a constantly evolving geopolitical landscape.','editor_review'=>'Rise of Kingdoms is among the most ambitious mobile strategy games ever created. The seamless open world where all server players interact in real time creates genuine political intrigue — alliances form, betray, and reform in fascinating ways. Commander progression is strategically deep, with skill trees that allow meaningful specialisation. The game demands sustained daily investment and benefits enormously from being part of an active alliance, but for dedicated strategy fans it offers unparalleled depth.','how_to_play'=>'Focus initially on gathering resources and completing City upgrades rather than attacking other players. Join an active alliance immediately — solo players are vulnerable targets and miss out on research and troop benefits. Research Economy technologies before Military in the early game. Choose Commanders whose specialisations complement each other — pair an Infantry and Leadership commander for versatile army compositions. Save Gems for VIP level upgrades and speed-ups during timed Kingdom events.'],

    ['title'=>'Plants vs. Zombies 2','pkg'=>'com.ea.game.pvz2_na','genres'=>['Strategy','Casual'],'developer'=>'ELECTRONIC ARTS','rating'=>4.4,'reviews'=>'7M','installs'=>'100M+','installs_raw'=>100000000,'size'=>'1.1GB','version'=>'11.9.1','updated'=>'April 2025','price'=>'Free','offline'=>false,'icon'=>'https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=PvZ2&background=6366f1&color=fff&size=256','age'=>'4+','category'=>'Strategy','playstore'=>'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.ea.game.pvz2_na','trending'=>74,'featured'=>false,'desc'=>'Plants vs. Zombies 2 continues the beloved tower defense adventure across six wildly different time periods — from Ancient Egypt to Far Future. Command an ever-growing roster of over 150 unique plants, each with special abilities and seed packet power-ups. Face thousands of zombie types, defeat massive Zombie Bosses, and compete in weekly Arena battles against other players. An Arena ranking system and frequent content updates ensure no two weeks feel the same.','editor_review'=>'PvZ2 has evolved substantially since launch and is now genuinely one of the best tower defence games on mobile. The variety of plants — each with distinct personalities and tactical roles — makes deck-building deeply strategic. The time-period level design is creative, introducing environmental hazards that force fresh tactical approaches. While plant levelling via seeds feels slightly pay-to-win in the Arena mode, the base campaign content is very generous for free players.','how_to_play'=>'Position Sun Flowers in the back rows for income generation, Peashooters and Melon-Pults in middle lanes for consistent damage, and Spikeweed or Snow Peas near the front to slow and damage advancing zombies. Save Plant Food for overwhelmed lanes rather than using it proactively. Study which zombies appear in each wave through the wave preview, then counter-build your plant selection before the battle starts.'],

    // ── CASUAL ──
    ['title'=>'Among Us','pkg'=>'com.innersloth.spacemafia','genres'=>['Casual','Multiplayer','Action'],'developer'=>'Innersloth LLC','rating'=>4.1,'reviews'=>'13M','installs'=>'500M+','installs_raw'=>500000000,'size'=>'130MB','version'=>'2025.3.5','updated'=>'March 2025','price'=>'Free','offline'=>false,'icon'=>'https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/CDsvE3N2aTT6B9MsTm4g5KJJbIiUQ4cpQoNLYzGWG8pzibU7JFDScDnjYbAEH7rh_Q','age'=>'9+','category'=>'Casual','playstore'=>'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.innersloth.spacemafia','trending'=>87,'featured'=>false,'desc'=>'Among Us is the social deduction phenomenon that swept the world. A crew of astronauts must complete tasks aboard a space station while hidden Impostors secretly sabotage and eliminate crew members. Survivors must identify and vote out the Impostors before they are eliminated, while Impostors must deflect suspicion and manipulate discussions to protect themselves. With customisable lobbies supporting 4-15 players, the social dynamics create endlessly unique and hilarious moments.','editor_review'=>'Among Us became a cultural moment because it perfectly captures the paranoia and drama of social deduction games in an accessible, visually inviting package. The task system gives Crewmates purpose beyond just discussing, and the kill animation is always a jolt of adrenaline. Playing with friends over voice chat elevates the experience dramatically. The developers have supported the game generously with free updates including new roles, maps, and cosmetics. A genuine landmark of social mobile gaming.','how_to_play'=>'As a Crewmate, complete tasks efficiently and pay attention to who seems unoccupied or loiters near dead bodies. Call Emergency Meetings when you witness suspicious behaviour. As an Impostor, create a believable alibi — claim to have seen another suspicious player and deflect accusations with confidence. Use sabotage to split the crew and create opportunities for kills in isolated locations. Vents allow instant repositioning but are visible to alert players.'],

    ['title'=>'My Talking Tom 2','pkg'=>'com.outfit7.mytalkingtom2','genres'=>['Casual','Simulation'],'developer'=>'Outfit7 Limited','rating'=>4.2,'reviews'=>'6M','installs'=>'500M+','installs_raw'=>500000000,'size'=>'250MB','version'=>'4.8.3','updated'=>'March 2025','price'=>'Free','offline'=>true,'icon'=>'https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=Tom2&background=ec4899&color=fff&size=256','age'=>'4+','category'=>'Casual','playstore'=>'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.outfit7.mytalkingtom2','trending'=>72,'featured'=>false,'desc'=>'My Talking Tom 2 lets you adopt and raise your very own virtual cat companion. Care for Tom by feeding, playing, bathing, and putting him to sleep — watch him grow from a tiny kitten into a fully grown cat with his own personality. Mini-games earn coins to unlock furniture and outfit Tom in hundreds of costumes and accessories. Tom reacts to your touch, talks back in a hilariously squeaky voice, and forms a genuine bond with dedicated players.','editor_review'=>'My Talking Tom 2 is the most polished virtual pet experience on mobile. Tom\'s animations are charming — watching him overeat and waddle around is oddly delightful. The wide selection of mini-games maintains engagement beyond just tapping and feeding, and the costume customisation gives players a meaningful creative outlet. It is an excellent game for younger audiences but has enough personality to entertain players of all ages. The care loop keeps you coming back just to check on your digital companion.','how_to_play'=>'Balance Tom\'s four needs — food, happiness, rest, and hygiene — regularly to keep him healthy. Mini-games like the sliding puzzle and bubble shoot earn the most coins per minute. Use coins to buy room decorations first as they boost Tom\'s happiness passively without active intervention. Log in daily to collect bonuses and complete the daily tasks for extra currency. The plant item permanently boosts food income when placed in Tom\'s room.'],

    ['title'=>'Hay Day','pkg'=>'com.supercell.hayday','genres'=>['Casual','Simulation'],'developer'=>'Supercell','rating'=>4.6,'reviews'=>'12M','installs'=>'100M+','installs_raw'=>100000000,'size'=>'255MB','version'=>'1.61.120','updated'=>'April 2025','price'=>'Free','offline'=>false,'icon'=>'https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=Hay+Day&background=ec4899&color=fff&size=256','age'=>'4+','category'=>'Casual','playstore'=>'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.supercell.hayday','trending'=>76,'featured'=>false,'desc'=>'Hay Day is the charming farming simulation where you grow crops, raise animals, and run a bustling country store. Plant wheat, corn, and indigo to feed your livestock and produce goods for sale. Expand your farm across rolling hills, build a fishing lake, and develop a riverside town with shops and services. Trade resources with neighbours and Neighbourhood members, compete in Neighbourhood Derbies, and participate in Global Events for rare prizes.','editor_review'=>'Hay Day remains the definitive mobile farming game more than a decade after launch. The art style is warm and inviting, the progression feels fair and rewarding, and the community features encourage genuine social interaction. The Derby system creates collaborative competition within Neighbourhoods that adds purpose to the farming loop. One significant strength is the real player economy on the roadside stands — buying and selling goods creates genuine market dynamics absent in competing titles.','how_to_play'=>'Always have crops growing and production machines running — idle production machines waste valuable time. Trade excess goods at your roadside stand and check neighbour stands for useful items at fair prices. During Derby season, focus on tasks that match your farm\'s current production capabilities rather than buying ingredients you do not have. Save Diamonds for expanding production machine slots rather than spending them on speed-ups.'],

    ['title'=>'Homescapes','pkg'=>'com.playrix.homescapes','genres'=>['Casual','Puzzle'],'developer'=>'Playrix','rating'=>4.5,'reviews'=>'10M','installs'=>'100M+','installs_raw'=>100000000,'size'=>'630MB','version'=>'7.5.1','updated'=>'April 2025','price'=>'Free','offline'=>false,'icon'=>'https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=Homescapes&background=ec4899&color=fff&size=256','age'=>'4+','category'=>'Casual','playstore'=>'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.playrix.homescapes','trending'=>78,'featured'=>false,'desc'=>'Homescapes combines match-3 puzzle gameplay with a home renovation storyline starring Austin the butler. Help Austin restore his childhood home room by room by completing puzzle levels to earn stars, then use those stars to choose furniture and design options. The story unfolds through witty dialogue and charming characters, making even simple interior design choices feel meaningful. Seasonal events and a robust content update schedule ensure there is always a new area to restore.','editor_review'=>'Homescapes cleverly wraps a compelling match-3 puzzle game inside a home renovation narrative that gives each level a purpose beyond simply matching three in a row. The renovation choices feel personal, and watching the dilapidated mansion transform room by room is genuinely satisfying. Austin is an endearing protagonist, and the family drama that unfolds across thousands of levels is more engaging than expected. The puzzle difficulty can spike sharply in mid-game, but the content volume is extraordinary.','how_to_play'=>'Create rockets by matching four tiles in a line, bombs from L-shapes and T-shapes, paper planes from any five-piece formation, and rockets from matching five in a row. Combining power-ups creates spectacular chain reactions. Plan renovation choices based on your aesthetic preferences — you are locked into those choices so take a moment to consider each decision. In difficult levels, focus on clearing obstacles near the objective tiles first rather than creating power-ups in open spaces.'],

    // ── SIMULATION ──
    ['title'=>'Minecraft','pkg'=>'com.mojang.minecraftpe','genres'=>['Simulation','Adventure','Open World'],'developer'=>'Mojang','rating'=>4.5,'reviews'=>'5M','installs'=>'50M+','installs_raw'=>50000000,'size'=>'590MB','version'=>'1.21.81','updated'=>'May 2025','price'=>'$7.49','offline'=>true,'icon'=>'https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/VSwHkBFGr2P2KJNfTbOBPpd5cqUkfHiXJKqFJDvIHfFtG_4s4W_MQeM8gN4N7oJwPw','age'=>'7+','category'=>'Simulation','playstore'=>'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.mojang.minecraftpe','trending'=>95,'featured'=>true,'desc'=>'Minecraft is the ultimate sandbox building and survival game, translated faithfully to Android. Explore procedurally generated worlds composed of millions of blocks, harvest resources, craft tools and weapons, build extraordinary structures from humble shelters to elaborate cities, and survive the night when creepers, skeletons, and zombies emerge from the darkness. Creative Mode removes limitations and gives unlimited resources for pure construction. Multiplayer Realms lets you share worlds with friends across platforms for collaborative projects.','editor_review'=>'Minecraft on mobile delivers the full experience that made the game the best-selling game of all time. The touch controls are well-adapted and feel natural after a short learning period. Cross-platform multiplayer with console and PC players expands the social possibilities enormously. The consistent major updates — each adding new biomes, mobs, and mechanics — ensure the game remains fresh years after purchase. The one-time premium price is the best investment in mobile gaming.','how_to_play'=>'Your first night is crucial — collect wood immediately, craft a crafting table, then build wooden tools and create a shelter before dark. Progress from wood to stone to iron to diamond tools for increasingly efficient resource gathering. Always carry a sword and torches. In survival mode, farming and food management becomes critical at medium difficulty. The Nether requires fire resistance and careful navigation but contains resources unavailable in the overworld.'],

    ['title'=>'Stardew Valley','pkg'=>'com.chucklefish.stardewvalley','genres'=>['Simulation','RPG','Offline'],'developer'=>'ConcernedApe','rating'=>4.7,'reviews'=>'150K','installs'=>'1M+','installs_raw'=>1000000,'size'=>'350MB','version'=>'1.6.0','updated'=>'March 2025','price'=>'$4.99','offline'=>true,'icon'=>'https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=Stardew&background=14b8a6&color=fff&size=256','age'=>'4+','category'=>'Simulation','playstore'=>'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.chucklefish.stardewvalley','trending'=>84,'featured'=>false,'desc'=>'Stardew Valley is the award-winning farming RPG where you inherit a run-down farm in the charming village of Pelican Town and build it into your dream homestead. Farm diverse crops across four seasons, raise chickens, cows, and pigs, explore dangerous mines for ores and artifacts, befriend and romance the colourful townsfolk, and restore the Community Centre by finding rare items. With over 70 hours of content and no pay-to-win mechanics, it is one of the most content-rich mobile games available.','editor_review'=>'Stardew Valley on mobile is a remarkable achievement — a complete and uncompromised port of a beloved PC game with thoughtfully adapted touch controls. Every system — farming, mining, fishing, relationships, crafting — is deep without being overwhelming. The day cycle creates natural play sessions with a clear daily to-do list, but the freedom to pursue your own goals makes every farm uniquely personal. At a one-time price with no ongoing monetisation, it represents exceptional value.','how_to_play'=>'Prioritise clearing your farm plot in the first spring to maximise crop space. Plant high-value seasonal crops like Strawberries in Spring and Starfruit in Summer for income. Mine to at least level 40 before summer ends to secure copper for sprinklers that automate watering. Befriend Villagers by giving them their favourite gifts on their birthdays for relationship progression. In winter, focus on mining, fishing, and crafting as farming stops during the cold season.'],

    ['title'=>'The Sims Mobile','pkg'=>'com.ea.games.simsmobile_na','genres'=>['Simulation','Casual'],'developer'=>'ELECTRONIC ARTS','rating'=>4.0,'reviews'=>'5M','installs'=>'100M+','installs_raw'=>100000000,'size'=>'950MB','version'=>'45.0.1','updated'=>'February 2025','price'=>'Free','offline'=>false,'icon'=>'https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=Sims+Mobile&background=14b8a6&color=fff&size=256','age'=>'12+','category'=>'Simulation','playstore'=>'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.ea.games.simsmobile_na','trending'=>74,'featured'=>false,'desc'=>'The Sims Mobile brings the iconic life simulation franchise to Android with a focus on personal stories, social interaction, and stylish customisation. Design your Sim\'s appearance, build and furnish their home, develop career skills through work events, pursue hobbies, and build relationships with other players\' Sims in the shared town. Legacy content passes life lessons to next-generation Sims, creating a generational family story across multiple play sessions.','editor_review'=>'The Sims Mobile is a faithful adaptation of the Sims formula for mobile play sessions. The social town element adds an interesting persistent world dimension not present in the mainline games, as other players\' homes and Sims populate the shared neighbourhood. Home customisation is impressively detailed with furniture and architecture that genuinely rivals the PC titles in variety. Energy systems limit session length but the game is at its best in short focused bursts anyway.','how_to_play'=>'Focus early sessions on career development by completing work events fully — career promotions unlock new item categories. Complete Relationship quests with NPC Sims to unlock story content. Home visitors from other players earn both parties SimCash, so keep your home visually interesting to attract guests. Attend community events posted on the events board for limited-time reward furniture unavailable through regular play.'],

    // ── ADVENTURE ──
    ['title'=>'Alto\'s Odyssey','pkg'=>'com.noodlecake.altosodyssey','genres'=>['Adventure','Arcade','Offline'],'developer'=>'Noodlecake','rating'=>4.7,'reviews'=>'200K','installs'=>'10M+','installs_raw'=>10000000,'size'=>'220MB','version'=>'1.0.16','updated'=>'September 2024','price'=>'Free','offline'=>true,'icon'=>'https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=Altos+Odyssey&background=84cc16&color=fff&size=256','age'=>'4+','category'=>'Adventure','playstore'=>'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.noodlecake.altosodyssey','trending'=>75,'featured'=>false,'desc'=>'Alto\'s Odyssey is a breathtaking endless snowboard journey through gorgeous desert landscapes, ancient ruins, and swirling sand dunes. Glide across dunes, grind across rooftops, bounce on hot air balloons, and perform tricks to score big. A dynamic weather system and day/night cycle transforms the environment in real time, creating an endlessly beautiful backdrop. Zen Mode removes goals entirely for a meditative experience set to a relaxing ambient soundtrack.','editor_review'=>'Alto\'s Odyssey may be the most visually stunning endless runner on Android. The vector art style captures mood through colour brilliantly — the amber sunset levels feel genuinely warm, and storm sequences create palpable tension. The physics-based trick system rewards experimentation rather than memorisation, and the challenge system provides structure without pressure. Zen Mode is a genuinely innovative addition, creating a space where the game becomes interactive ambient art. A masterpiece of mobile game aesthetics.','how_to_play'=>'Tap and hold to jump and backflip — timing the release during the jump arc maximises trick combo potential. Grind rails and balloon ropes immediately after landing for additional combo time. The elder Llama companion activates shield abilities from certain wings — choose your character based on the current challenge requirements. In Zen Mode, focus simply on the flow of movement without worrying about objectives.'],

    ['title'=>'Terraria','pkg'=>'com.and.games505.TerrariaPaid','genres'=>['Adventure','Simulation','Offline'],'developer'=>'505 Games Srl','rating'=>4.6,'reviews'=>'600K','installs'=>'5M+','installs_raw'=>5000000,'size'=>'270MB','version'=>'1.4.5','updated'=>'December 2024','price'=>'$4.99','offline'=>true,'icon'=>'https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=Terraria&background=84cc16&color=fff&size=256','age'=>'12+','category'=>'Adventure','playstore'=>'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.and.games505.TerrariaPaid','trending'=>80,'featured'=>false,'desc'=>'Terraria is a 2D sandbox adventure game with extraordinary depth. Dig, build, craft, and fight your way through a procedurally generated world teeming with dozens of unique biomes, hundreds of enemy types, and over 20 challenging bosses. The game transitions naturally from a building sandbox to an intense action experience as you progress, culminating in legendary endgame encounters. Over 1600 craftable items and 380 enemies make every playthrough genuinely unique.','editor_review'=>'Terraria is one of the deepest mobile gaming experiences available at any price. The transition from cautious exploration to confident boss-slaying is one of gaming\'s most satisfying progressions, and achieving it on a touch screen is a genuine accomplishment by the developers. The touch controls are well optimised, and the complete content parity with PC versions — including all major updates — means you are getting one of the most content-rich games in existence. The premium one-time price is more than justified.','how_to_play'=>'Dig downward carefully to gather ores and discover underground biomes. Build a safe base with solid walls and doors before nightfall, as surface enemies become dangerous at night. Craft a workbench immediately then progress to furnace, anvil, and tinkerer\'s workshop for crafting tiers. Defeat the Eye of Cthulhu as your first boss for early game gear progression. Bring adequate healing potions and maintain accessories in each slot — accessory power is often more impactful than weapon choice.'],

    ['title'=>'Dead Cells: Return to Castlevania','pkg'=>'com.playdigious.deadcells.mobile','genres'=>['Adventure','Action','Offline'],'developer'=>'Motion Twin','rating'=>4.5,'reviews'=>'100K','installs'=>'1M+','installs_raw'=>1000000,'size'=>'2.1GB','version'=>'3.5.8','updated'=>'April 2025','price'=>'$9.99','offline'=>true,'icon'=>'https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=Dead+Cells&background=84cc16&color=fff&size=256','age'=>'17+','category'=>'Adventure','playstore'=>'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.playdigious.deadcells.mobile','trending'=>78,'featured'=>false,'desc'=>'Dead Cells is a roguelike metroidvania that challenges you to fight through a constantly changing dungeon with precise, demanding combat. Each run generates new weapon placements and enemy configurations, ensuring no two attempts feel identical. Die and you return to the beginning — but permanent upgrades and unlocked shortcuts make each death a learning experience. The Castlevania DLC adds iconic locations, characters, and remixed classic music for fans of the legendary series.','editor_review'=>'Dead Cells on mobile is simply one of the best games available on the platform, period. The combat is precise and deeply satisfying — building a synergistic weapon and mutation combination that comes together beautifully mid-run creates a rush unlike most games. The challenge is high but fair, and the roguelike structure means failure always feels productive. The mobile port is exceptional, with controls that make demanding combat feel manageable on touchscreen. Worth every penny of its premium price.','how_to_play'=>'Focus on building synergies between your two weapons and the mutations you select at level-up. Survival mutations like Predator and Soldier\'s Resistance extend your runs significantly early on. Parrying enemy attacks is crucial at higher difficulties — timing the parry shield activates a powerful counter. Explore every corner of each biome for scrolls that permanently increase your stats. Prioritise unlocking permanent cells upgrades that activate the strongest starting weapon variants.'],

    // ── EDUCATIONAL ──
    ['title'=>'Duolingo','pkg'=>'com.duolingo','genres'=>['Educational','Casual'],'developer'=>'Duolingo','rating'=>4.7,'reviews'=>'20M','installs'=>'500M+','installs_raw'=>500000000,'size'=>'60MB','version'=>'5.180.0','updated'=>'May 2025','price'=>'Free','offline'=>true,'icon'=>'https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=Duolingo&background=06b6d4&color=fff&size=256','age'=>'13+','category'=>'Educational','playstore'=>'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.duolingo','trending'=>88,'featured'=>false,'desc'=>'Duolingo is the world\'s most popular language learning app, making language acquisition feel like playing a game. Choose from 40+ languages including Spanish, French, Japanese, Korean, and even Klingon. Complete bite-sized daily lessons covering vocabulary, grammar, reading, and listening comprehension. The streak system gamifies daily practice, while leagues and leaderboards create friendly competition with other learners. Duolingo\'s research-backed curriculum has helped millions of people achieve conversational fluency.','editor_review'=>'Duolingo has genuinely democratised language learning. The lesson design is psychologically brilliant — the variable reward schedule, streak anxiety, and social leaderboards create habit formation that traditional textbooks cannot replicate. Lessons are well-paced and the transition from simple vocabulary to natural sentence construction is smooth. While Duolingo alone will not make you fluent, it creates the vocabulary foundation and habit of daily practice that serious language learning requires. The free tier is impressively complete.','how_to_play'=>'Aim for at least 10 minutes of daily practice to maintain your streak. Choose a reasonable daily XP goal initially — perfectionism early on leads to burnout. Complete the full learning path rather than jumping between skills. When a skill drops below five bubbles, practise it to strengthen memory. Legendary challenges at the gold tier require perfect performance and earn Trophy badges that show your mastery.'],

    ['title'=>'Photomath','pkg'=>'com.microblink.photomath','genres'=>['Educational'],'developer'=>'Photomath, Inc.','rating'=>4.7,'reviews'=>'3M','installs'=>'100M+','installs_raw'=>100000000,'size'=>'75MB','version'=>'9.2.0','updated'=>'March 2025','price'=>'Free','offline'=>true,'icon'=>'https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=Photomath&background=06b6d4&color=fff&size=256','age'=>'4+','category'=>'Educational','playstore'=>'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.microblink.photomath','trending'=>79,'featured'=>false,'desc'=>'Photomath uses your camera to read and solve maths problems instantly — from basic arithmetic and fractions through algebra, calculus, and statistics. Point your camera at a handwritten or printed problem and see not just the answer but a full step-by-step solution breakdown. Multiple solution methods are shown where applicable, helping students understand different approaches to the same problem. An integrated calculator and graph plotter extend the app\'s utility beyond just scanning.','editor_review'=>'Photomath is genuinely transformative for students struggling with maths. The step-by-step explanation format teaches methodology rather than just providing answers, which makes it a legitimate learning tool rather than simple cheating. Recognition accuracy for handwritten equations is remarkably high, and the breadth of topics covered — from primary school arithmetic through university-level calculus — is extraordinary. The free tier covers most standard curriculum content, and the premium subscription adds deeper animated explanations.','how_to_play'=>'Point the camera at any maths problem and align it within the scanning frame — the red line should pass through the equation. Tap the calculator icon for manual input if camera scanning struggles with unclear handwriting. Tap any step in the solution to expand it for a fuller explanation. Use the graphing calculator for visualising functions and identifying intersection points. Save solutions to the History tab for revision before tests.'],

    // ── MULTIPLAYER ──
    ['title'=>'Roblox','pkg'=>'com.roblox.client','genres'=>['Simulation','Multiplayer','Adventure'],'developer'=>'Roblox Corporation','rating'=>4.4,'reviews'=>'30M','installs'=>'500M+','installs_raw'=>500000000,'size'=>'175MB','version'=>'2.624.439','updated'=>'May 2025','price'=>'Free','offline'=>false,'icon'=>'https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/oBZgVH9nT4kB2CjTSxCGW1UNJL3uG0_qI4JjMEGzMQODHpJmGJnFqtHMaEJnAuR4bQ','age'=>'7+','category'=>'Multiplayer','playstore'=>'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.roblox.client','trending'=>97,'featured'=>true,'desc'=>'Roblox is the ultimate virtual universe where you can create, share, and play an infinite variety of experiences built by a global community of developers. Explore millions of user-created worlds — from obstacle courses and military simulators to virtual concerts and horror games. Customise your avatar with thousands of items, build your own games using Roblox Studio, and socialise with friends in a safe, moderated environment. Monthly updates and developer events keep the platform constantly evolving.','editor_review'=>'Roblox defies conventional categorisation — it is simultaneously a game, a platform, and a creative tool. The sheer breadth of experiences available means it genuinely has something for every kind of player. Some community-developed games rival commercially produced titles in production quality. The social features create genuine friendships across the globe. Robux monetisation can feel aggressive in some experiences, but many games are entirely free. It is arguably the most significant gaming platform of the current generation.','how_to_play'=>'Use the catalog to equip free avatar items before spending Robux. Bookmark your favourite games from the home screen for quick access. In simulator games, find the most efficient early-game income source and automate it. In competitive games, study the meta of the specific experience rather than relying on general Roblox skills. Join groups linked to your favourite games for exclusive items and events.'],

    ['title'=>'Pokémon GO','pkg'=>'com.nianticlabs.pokemongo','genres'=>['Adventure','Multiplayer'],'developer'=>'Niantic, Inc.','rating'=>4.1,'reviews'=>'10M','installs'=>'500M+','installs_raw'=>500000000,'size'=>'240MB','version'=>'0.325.0','updated'=>'April 2025','price'=>'Free','offline'=>false,'icon'=>'https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/6MVxCt5mXxl3FRrVbH7m3EoC6n6mRHIDI6NMtS0-pBWr2FvDdPgK7JlU7y-MrP4L9Q','age'=>'9+','category'=>'Multiplayer','playstore'=>'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.nianticlabs.pokemongo','trending'=>90,'featured'=>false,'desc'=>'Pokémon GO brings the beloved franchise into the real world through augmented reality, encouraging you to explore your local environment to catch Pokémon, visit PokéStops at landmarks, and battle in Gym raids with other players. Seasonal events, Community Days, and global Pokémon GO Fest create a vibrant calendar of shared experiences. The Buddy Adventure system develops a bond with your chosen Pokémon through shared activities. Over 800 Pokémon species are now available across multiple generations.','editor_review'=>'Pokémon GO achieved something remarkable by making exercise feel like an adventure and turning anonymous city streets into shared gaming arenas. The raid battle system creates spontaneous communities around Gyms, and Community Days remain one of the best recurring gaming events in the industry. The AR camera mode creates genuinely magical moments of Pokémon appearing in the real world. Later generations added depth through breeding equivalents, PvP Trainer Battles, and increasingly complex raid mechanics.','how_to_play'=>'Spin PokéStops daily for items and catch Pokémon consistently to build candy for evolutions. Prioritise catching Pokémon with high Individual Values — check IVs using the in-game appraisal system before investing in a Pokémon. Raid Passes are precious; save them for high-tier Legendary raids. In Trainer Battles, mastering the switch-bait technique — switching Pokémon to bait opponents into using their shields on lower-priority threats — is the key competitive skill.'],

    ['title'=>'Stumble Guys','pkg'=>'com.kitkagames.fallbuddies','genres'=>['Multiplayer','Casual','Action'],'developer'=>'Scopely','rating'=>4.4,'reviews'=>'8M','installs'=>'100M+','installs_raw'=>100000000,'size'=>'400MB','version'=>'0.75.3','updated'=>'May 2025','price'=>'Free','offline'=>false,'icon'=>'https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=Stumble+Guys&background=a855f7&color=fff&size=256','age'=>'4+','category'=>'Multiplayer','playstore'=>'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.kitkagames.fallbuddies','trending'=>87,'featured'=>false,'desc'=>'Stumble Guys is the chaotic 32-player battle royale where rounds of absurd obstacle courses eliminate players until one champion remains. Race through rotating platforms, dodge giant boulders, navigate spinning hammers, and outmanoeuvre opponents across creative levels. Colourful costumes, emotes, and victory animations make surviving each elimination round a cause for genuine celebration. New levels and seasonal content keep the frantic fun evolving every week.','editor_review'=>'Stumble Guys captures the joyful chaos of Fall Guys and delivers it accessibly on mobile. The randomness means even new players can occasionally triumph, keeping the experience welcoming while still rewarding skilled movement and timing. The variety of elimination round types — racing, survival, and team games — prevents any particular strategy from dominating. The customisation options are extensive and the animated emotes add personality to every match. Brilliantly fun with friends.','how_to_play'=>'Positioning matters more than speed in most rounds — follow the clearest path rather than the most direct route to avoid being caught in a crowd pile-up. In rotating platform levels, observe the full rotation pattern for one cycle before committing to a crossing attempt. Use the dive mechanic to extend jumps and survive on moving platforms longer. In team elimination rounds, support teamwork objectives rather than focusing on personal score.'],

    // ── OFFLINE GAMES ──
    ['title'=>'Mini Metro','pkg'=>'nz.co.codepoint.minimetro','genres'=>['Puzzle','Simulation','Offline'],'developer'=>'Dinosaur Polo Club','rating'=>4.6,'reviews'=>'80K','installs'=>'1M+','installs_raw'=>1000000,'size'=>'130MB','version'=>'2.60.0','updated'=>'October 2024','price'=>'$1.99','offline'=>true,'icon'=>'https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=Mini+Metro&background=64748b&color=fff&size=256','age'=>'4+','category'=>'Puzzle','playstore'=>'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=nz.co.codepoint.minimetro','trending'=>68,'featured'=>false,'desc'=>'Mini Metro is an elegant puzzle game where you build a minimalist metro system for a growing city. Connect stations of matching shapes with coloured lines, manage passenger flow, and expand your network using weekly resources. Stations grow and passengers accumulate — when any station becomes too overcrowded, the game ends. Real cities from London and Tokyo to Mumbai and São Paulo feature in the game, each with unique geographical constraints.','editor_review'=>'Mini Metro is a masterpiece of restrained design. Every element — the clean vector aesthetics, the ambient generative soundtrack, the progressive difficulty — contributes to an experience of satisfying elegance. Managing the exponentially growing demands of a city system without extra clutter creates genuine intellectual tension. The Extreme difficulty mode and leaderboards provide challenge for serious players while Normal mode remains relaxing. One of the finest puzzle games available on any platform.','how_to_play'=>'Prioritise connecting the newest stations immediately upon their appearance to prevent early overcrowding. Use interchange stations where multiple lines meet to maximise passenger distribution efficiency. Save tunnel resources for rivers and geographical barriers rather than using them for convenience. When a line becomes critically overcrowded, do not hesitate to reroute it even if this temporarily inconveniences other lines.'],

    ['title'=>'Shadowgun Legends','pkg'=>'com.madfingergames.legends','genres'=>['Action','RPG','Offline'],'developer'=>'MADFINGER Games','rating'=>4.4,'reviews'=>'500K','installs'=>'10M+','installs_raw'=>10000000,'size'=>'2.5GB','version'=>'1.3.0','updated'=>'August 2024','price'=>'Free','offline'=>true,'icon'=>'https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=Shadowgun&background=64748b&color=fff&size=256','age'=>'17+','category'=>'Action','playstore'=>'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.madfingergames.legends','trending'=>70,'featured'=>false,'desc'=>'Shadowgun Legends is a premium first-person shooter with deep RPG progression set in a science fiction universe. Play through a full story campaign against alien invaders, then take the fight online in competitive and cooperative multiplayer modes. The shared hub world allows players to interact, trade, and form squads. A vast loot system with thousands of weapon and armour combinations drives a compelling gear-hunting progression loop across the campaign and multiplayer.','editor_review'=>'Shadowgun Legends punches well above its mobile class with production values that genuinely rival console shooters from a few years prior. The story campaign is surprisingly substantial, and the RPG loot system transforms gunfighting into a meaningful progression experience. The hub world social features give the game a community dimension that elevates it beyond a simple shooter. Performance is demanding but playable on mid-range devices. For FPS fans wanting a premium mobile experience, Shadowgun Legends delivers.','how_to_play'=>'Complete all campaign chapters before investing heavily in multiplayer gear, as campaign drops provide a solid baseline. In combat, use cover aggressively — the dodge mechanic is essential for avoiding damage. Prioritise gear with Critical Hit Chance and Damage bonuses for damage dealers, and Armour and Health bonuses for survivability builds. Joining a guild unlocks group activities with significantly better rewards than solo play.'],

    // ── MORE POPULAR GAMES ──
    ['title'=>'Mobile Legends: Bang Bang','pkg'=>'com.mobile.legends','genres'=>['Action','Multiplayer','Strategy'],'developer'=>'Moonton Technology','rating'=>4.3,'reviews'=>'20M','installs'=>'500M+','installs_raw'=>500000000,'size'=>'600MB','version'=>'1.9.18','updated'=>'May 2025','price'=>'Free','offline'=>false,'icon'=>'https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=ML+Bang+Bang&background=ef4444&color=fff&size=256','age'=>'12+','category'=>'Action','playstore'=>'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.mobile.legends','trending'=>94,'featured'=>true,'desc'=>'Mobile Legends: Bang Bang is the premier 5v5 MOBA on Android with explosive real-time team battles. Choose from over 120 heroes across six roles — Fighter, Assassin, Mage, Marksman, Tank, and Support — then coordinate with your team to destroy the enemy nexus. Ranked mode features a competitive ladder spanning Warrior to Mythical Glory. Regular hero releases, seasonal events, and an active esports scene make this the most complete mobile MOBA experience available.','editor_review'=>'Mobile Legends set the standard for mobile MOBAs with 10-minute matches perfectly calibrated for touchscreen play. The hero roster is impressively diverse — each hero has a distinct playstyle that rewards mastery. The ranking system is satisfying to climb, and the community around the game is enormous, ensuring you can always find a competitive match. Draft mode in higher ranks adds a strategic layer that rewards deep game knowledge. The most polished mobile MOBA available.','how_to_play'=>'Learn the minimap — tracking enemy positions is the difference between good and great players. Play each role correctly: tanks engage first, assassins isolate squishies, mages burst grouped enemies, marksmen deal sustained damage safely from range. Jungling efficiently in the early game creates gold leads that determine which team wins the mid-game. Secure turtle at 4 minutes and lord during the power spike of your composition.'],

    ['title'=>'Dragon Ball Legends','pkg'=>'com.bandainamcoent.dblegends_ww','genres'=>['Action','RPG','Multiplayer'],'developer'=>'BANDAI NAMCO Entertainment Inc.','rating'=>4.1,'reviews'=>'4M','installs'=>'50M+','installs_raw'=>50000000,'size'=>'2.5GB','version'=>'5.10.1','updated'=>'April 2025','price'=>'Free','offline'=>false,'icon'=>'https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=DB+Legends&background=8b5cf6&color=fff&size=256','age'=>'12+','category'=>'Action','playstore'=>'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.bandainamcoent.dblegends_ww','trending'=>82,'featured'=>false,'desc'=>'Dragon Ball Legends brings the iconic anime franchise to mobile with dynamic 3D battles featuring characters across the entire Dragon Ball universe — from the original series through Super and GT. Build a team of three fighters, each with unique Arts Cards that power up abilities, and battle in real-time PvP against opponents worldwide. The Rising Battle system features anime-accurate fight recreations, and new story content regularly extends the Legends narrative.','editor_review'=>'Dragon Ball Legends is the definitive Dragon Ball game on mobile. The card-based combat system rewards strategic card management over simple button mashing, and the dodge mechanic adds a real-time layer that creates exciting risk-reward decisions. Character art and animations are faithful to the source material, and seeing favourite characters interact in the original story mode is a treat for fans. The gacha rates can be punishing for top-tier characters, but the game is generous enough with Chrono Crystals for patient players.','how_to_play'=>'Time your Vanish steps to dodge the opponent\'s rising rush attacks — the window is narrow but essential for advanced play. Use Z-Ability combinations between your team\'s three characters to maximise stat bonuses. Manage your green Ki gauge carefully — never let it drop to zero as you become temporarily stunned. Main Ability cards are powerful but have long cooldowns — save them for decisive moments rather than using immediately.'],

    ['title'=>'Garena Free Fire MAX','pkg'=>'com.dts.freefiremax','genres'=>['Action','Battle Royale'],'developer'=>'Garena International I','rating'=>4.0,'reviews'=>'10M','installs'=>'100M+','installs_raw'=>100000000,'size'=>'1.1GB','version'=>'2.103.1','updated'=>'May 2025','price'=>'Free','offline'=>false,'icon'=>'https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=Free+Fire+MAX&background=ef4444&color=fff&size=256','age'=>'12+','category'=>'Action','playstore'=>'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.dts.freefiremax','trending'=>88,'featured'=>false,'desc'=>'Free Fire MAX is the enhanced version of Free Fire featuring upgraded graphics, immersive sound design, and exclusive visual effects while maintaining cross-play with standard Free Fire players. Engage in battle royale matches with enhanced environmental details, dynamic lighting, and smoother animations. All game content, items, and accounts are shared between Free Fire and Free Fire MAX, ensuring the full player base remains accessible.','editor_review'=>'Free Fire MAX is Free Fire as it was always meant to look. The visual upgrade is substantial — lighting, shadows, and environmental detail are dramatically improved over the base version, creating a significantly more cinematic experience. The cross-play infrastructure is clever, preventing player base fragmentation while still offering enhanced players a premium visual experience. If your device can run it, MAX is unambiguously the better version.','how_to_play'=>'Identical to Free Fire in gameplay — use character abilities strategically, engage in close-range fights with shotguns and SMGs, prefer rifles for mid-range engagements. The enhanced graphics in MAX can actually aid gameplay by making distant enemies and loot more visible. Enable high-performance mode in settings to maximise frame rate at the cost of visual detail during combat.'],

    ['title'=>'Toon Blast','pkg'=>'net.peakgames.toonblast','genres'=>['Puzzle','Casual'],'developer'=>'Peak','rating'=>4.6,'reviews'=>'6M','installs'=>'100M+','installs_raw'=>100000000,'size'=>'200MB','version'=>'11023','updated'=>'April 2025','price'=>'Free','offline'=>false,'icon'=>'https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=Toon+Blast&background=ec4899&color=fff&size=256','age'=>'4+','category'=>'Puzzle','playstore'=>'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=net.peakgames.toonblast','trending'=>79,'featured'=>false,'desc'=>'Toon Blast is a colourful blast puzzle game starring Cooper Cat, Wally Wolf, and Bruno Bear on cartoon adventures. Match cubes of the same colour to clear levels, collect required items, and complete objectives within a limited number of moves. Create rockets, bombs, and disco balls from large cube groups to clear massive sections of the board. Join a team to request lives, send gifts, and compete in team battles for exclusive rewards.','editor_review'=>'Toon Blast is one of the most polished blast puzzle games in a crowded genre. The power-up combination system creates spectacular chain reactions that remain satisfying thousands of levels in. The cartoonish characters are genuinely charming, and the episodic storyline adds narrative motivation to clear each world. Team mechanics add a social dimension that makes the game considerably more engaging than playing alone. A reliable comfort game with enormous content volume.','how_to_play'=>'Prioritise creating rockets and bombs by matching four or five cubes together before clearing smaller groups. Combine power-ups for dramatic effects — two rockets cross the board in both directions simultaneously. In objective levels, identify which colour cubes block the required items and clear those first. Save your team life requests for levels where you are genuinely stuck rather than wasting them on early attempts.'],

    ['title'=>'Gardenscapes','pkg'=>'com.playrix.gardenscapes','genres'=>['Casual','Puzzle'],'developer'=>'Playrix','rating'=>4.3,'reviews'=>'8M','installs'=>'100M+','installs_raw'=>100000000,'size'=>'490MB','version'=>'8.5.1','updated'=>'April 2025','price'=>'Free','offline'=>false,'icon'=>'https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=Gardenscapes&background=10b981&color=fff&size=256','age'=>'4+','category'=>'Casual','playstore'=>'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.playrix.gardenscapes','trending'=>75,'featured'=>false,'desc'=>'Gardenscapes stars Austin the butler as you work together to restore a vast family estate garden to its former glory. Complete match-3 puzzle levels to earn stars, then spend those stars on garden renovations — from repairing the fountain to building gazebos and planting seasonal flowers. A warm storyline involving Austin\'s past and the estate\'s history unfolds alongside the garden restoration, giving every design choice narrative context.','editor_review'=>'Gardenscapes refined the meta-game puzzle formula that Homescapes later perfected. The garden setting is more visually diverse than a house interior, with outdoor spaces that transform dramatically through renovation milestones. Austin\'s witty commentary is genuinely funny, and the seasonal garden events add beautiful time-limited decorative elements. The puzzle difficulty can be frustratingly sharp in certain mid-game chapters, but the renovation rewards make pushing through worthwhile.','how_to_play'=>'Spend stars efficiently on renovation tasks that unlock the next story chapter rather than purely cosmetic options. In match-3 levels, identify the objective first — clearing specific elements requires targeting those tiles rather than making random matches. Unlock Shovel and Bomb boosters for difficult levels rather than spending Coins on extra moves. Play during daily bonus events for double-star rewards on completed levels.'],

    ['title'=>'Merge Dragons!','pkg'=>'com.gramgames.mergedragons','genres'=>['Casual','Puzzle','Simulation'],'developer'=>'Gram Games','rating'=>4.4,'reviews'=>'3M','installs'=>'50M+','installs_raw'=>50000000,'size'=>'400MB','version'=>'12.0.0','updated'=>'March 2025','price'=>'Free','offline'=>false,'icon'=>'https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=Merge+Dragons&background=ec4899&color=fff&size=256','age'=>'4+','category'=>'Casual','playstore'=>'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.gramgames.mergedragons','trending'=>73,'featured'=>false,'desc'=>'Merge Dragons is a magical puzzle adventure where you merge nearly everything you see — dragon eggs, plants, buildings, and treasures — to create more powerful versions and heal a corrupted land. Hatch and collect adorable dragons who harvest resources for you automatically. Solve puzzle camp levels to earn special items and currency. A vast camp world expands progressively as your dragon collection grows stronger, offering thousands of objects to merge and discover.','editor_review'=>'Merge Dragons built an entire genre of mobile games with its satisfying merge loop. The auto-harvesting dragons create passive income that makes returning to the game after hours away consistently rewarding. Discovering new merge chains and uncovering the healing mechanic in puzzle levels delivers a genuine sense of discovery. The game is long — enormous amounts of content are available — but the idle nature means it never demands intense focus. A perfect low-commitment companion game.','how_to_play'=>'Always merge in sets of five rather than three when possible — merging five produces two of the next tier item instead of one, effectively doubling output. Keep your camp organised by grouping items of the same type to make triple merges easier to spot. Prioritise healing dead land in your camp to expand available space. Complete puzzle levels regularly to earn Dragon Gems and rare items unavailable through camp play.'],

    ['title'=>'Royal Match','pkg'=>'com.dreamgames.royalmatch','genres'=>['Puzzle','Casual'],'developer'=>'Dream Games','rating'=>4.7,'reviews'=>'4M','installs'=>'50M+','installs_raw'=>50000000,'size'=>'250MB','version'=>'25441','updated'=>'April 2025','price'=>'Free','offline'=>false,'icon'=>'https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=Royal+Match&background=eab308&color=fff&size=256','age'=>'4+','category'=>'Puzzle','playstore'=>'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.dreamgames.royalmatch','trending'=>88,'featured'=>false,'desc'=>'Royal Match is the polished match-3 puzzle game where you help King Robert renovate his royal palace. Complete match-3 levels to earn stars that fund palace upgrades across multiple areas — the throne room, gardens, ballroom, and tower. The level design is consistently creative, introducing unique mechanics and obstacles that keep the formula fresh across thousands of stages. Team events and competitive tournaments provide weekly social and competitive goals.','editor_review'=>'Royal Match has earned its position as the top-grossing puzzle game through genuinely excellent level design and satisfying progression. Unlike competitors, the difficulty curve is exceptionally well calibrated — challenging enough to require strategic thinking without becoming artificially impossible. The palace renovation images are beautiful, and the animation polish on power-up effects is impressive. The team championship mode creates authentic competitive tension. Currently the gold standard of the match-3 genre.','how_to_play'=>'Create Rockets by matching four tiles, Bombs by matching five in an L or T shape, and Propellers from matching five in a row. Combining a Rocket and Bomb clears a large cross-shaped area. The Light Ball created from matching five in a straight line clears all tiles of a target colour when combined with another power-up. Study the objective before moving and plan your first three moves before touching the board.'],

    ['title'=>'Coin Master','pkg'=>'com.moonactive.coinmaster','genres'=>['Casual','Simulation'],'developer'=>'Moon Active','rating'=>4.2,'reviews'=>'10M','installs'=>'100M+','installs_raw'=>100000000,'size'=>'200MB','version'=>'3.5.1600','updated'=>'April 2025','price'=>'Free','offline'=>false,'icon'=>'https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=Coin+Master&background=ec4899&color=fff&size=256','age'=>'13+','category'=>'Casual','playstore'=>'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.moonactive.coinmaster','trending'=>82,'featured'=>false,'desc'=>'Coin Master combines slot machine mechanics with village building in a unique casual game that has captured hundreds of millions of players. Spin the slot machine to earn coins, attack rivals\' villages, raid their stored coins, or activate shields for protection. Use earned coins to build and upgrade your village through colourful themed worlds, then move on to the next. Collect complete card sets for significant rewards and showcase accomplishments in the championship leaderboards.','editor_review'=>'Coin Master\'s genius lies in how social vulnerability creates genuine emotional investment — being raided by a friend simultaneously frustrates and motivates retaliation. The village progression gives purpose to each spin, and card collecting adds a meta-game layer that drives long-term engagement. The spin economy is generous with free spins from friends and hourly regeneration, making extended sessions possible without spending. The social features — raiding and attacking real contacts — make it genuinely more fun than playing in isolation.','how_to_play'=>'Always shield your village before logging out by hitting three shields on the slot machine. Save spins during active events that reward bonus cards or coin bonuses for spinning. Trade cards with friends in the trading group to complete sets faster. Attack and raid early in the morning when many players have been accumulating resources overnight without spending. Upgrade villages quickly rather than perfecting each — moving to a new village resets your vulnerability to attacks.'],

    ['title'=>'Ludo King','pkg'=>'com.ludo.king','genres'=>['Board','Multiplayer','Offline'],'developer'=>'Gametion Technologies Pvt Ltd','rating'=>4.4,'reviews'=>'8M','installs'=>'500M+','installs_raw'=>500000000,'size'=>'110MB','version'=>'9.5.0','updated'=>'March 2025','price'=>'Free','offline'=>true,'icon'=>'https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=Ludo+King&background=a855f7&color=fff&size=256','age'=>'3+','category'=>'Board','playstore'=>'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.ludo.king','trending'=>83,'featured'=>false,'desc'=>'Ludo King brings the classic board game Ludo to Android with online multiplayer, voice chat, and multiple themed boards. Play with 2-6 players online against friends or strangers, in local pass-and-play mode, or compete against challenging AI opponents. Roll the dice, race your tokens around the board, and block opponents while protecting your own pieces. Special bonus dice rolls, power tokens, and seasonal themes add modern excitement to the timeless family game.','editor_review'=>'Ludo King succeeded by digitising the most universally beloved South Asian board game with an accessible online infrastructure that connected families across distances. The voice chat feature during matches creates the authentic table-game atmosphere that online gaming usually lacks. Multiple board themes keep the visual experience fresh, and the AI difficulty levels span genuinely easy to surprisingly challenging. It remains the definitive mobile Ludo experience.','how_to_play'=>'Prioritise safe squares that are immune to captures — landing on them protects your tokens from elimination. Open all four tokens from home base early rather than advancing one token far ahead, reducing the risk of losing significant progress to a single capture. Target opponent tokens near the finish line if you can reach them, as they typically carry the most accumulated board position. When safe squares are occupied by your own tokens, they form blockades that opponents cannot pass.'],

    ['title'=>'UNO!','pkg'=>'com.mattel.uno','genres'=>['Card','Multiplayer'],'developer'=>'Mattel163 Limited','rating'=>4.3,'reviews'=>'6M','installs'=>'100M+','installs_raw'=>100000000,'size'=>'290MB','version'=>'1.11.0035','updated'=>'March 2025','price'=>'Free','offline'=>false,'icon'=>'https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=UNO&background=a855f7&color=fff&size=256','age'=>'4+','category'=>'Card','playstore'=>'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.mattel.uno','trending'=>77,'featured'=>false,'desc'=>'UNO! is the official digital version of the world\'s most popular card game with real-time online multiplayer for 2-4 players. Match cards by colour or number, play action cards to skip opponents, reverse play order, make opponents draw cards, and declare UNO when you are down to your last card. Multiple themed rooms — including partner mode and various house rules — keep the experience varied. Watch friends\' animated reactions and emotes for authentic social energy.','editor_review'=>'UNO! captures the social electricity of the physical card game remarkably well in digital form. The emoji and quick emote system provides just enough communication to create memorable moments without requiring voice chat. Partner mode adds a cooperative dimension that changes the strategic calculus entirely. The theme rooms with modified rules keep regular players engaged beyond the classic format. Connection stability has improved dramatically in recent updates, and matches flow smoothly.','how_to_play'=>'Hold action cards — Skip, Reverse, Draw Two — until you can play them strategically rather than discarding them immediately. Stack Draw Two and Draw Four cards when opponents call UNO to reverse their advantage. Choose your Wild card colour declaration based on the most common colour in your current hand. Calling UNO loudly through the in-game button is essential — failure to call before another player catches you results in a penalty draw.'],

    ['title'=>'Pou','pkg'=>'me.pou.app','genres'=>['Casual','Simulation','Offline'],'developer'=>'Paul Salameh','rating'=>4.4,'reviews'=>'8M','installs'=>'500M+','installs_raw'=>500000000,'size'=>'70MB','version'=>'1.4.130','updated'=>'November 2024','price'=>'Free','offline'=>true,'icon'=>'https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=Pou&background=ec4899&color=fff&size=256','age'=>'4+','category'=>'Casual','playstore'=>'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=me.pou.app','trending'=>65,'featured'=>false,'desc'=>'Pou is the beloved virtual alien pet that you care for by feeding, bathing, and playing mini-games together. Customise Pou\'s hat, outfit, background, and wallpaper with hundreds of unlockable items purchased using in-game coins earned through mini-games. 27 mini-games covering everything from puzzle solving to tower defence provide a varied gaming experience within a single app. Pou grows over time as you increase its levels across four distinct attributes.','editor_review'=>'Pou remains one of the most charming virtual pet experiences on Android through sheer personality. The variety of mini-games within a single app is extraordinary for the file size, covering enough genres to appeal to diverse tastes. Pou\'s personality develops in subtle ways that make the attachment genuine over time. The game respects players by keeping the monetisation entirely within earned coins rather than demanding real money. A generous, joyful app that has earned its place in mobile gaming history.','how_to_play'=>'Play the mini-games most suited to your skills frequently to maximise coin earnings. Feed Pou regularly to maintain happiness levels and unlock growth milestones. Purchase wallpapers first as they provide passive happiness boosts that reduce how often you need to actively play with Pou. Among the mini-games, Food Drop and Potions typically offer the best coins-per-minute ratio for players who practice them.'],

    ['title'=>'Hearthstone','pkg'=>'com.blizzard.wtcg.hearthstone','genres'=>['Card','Strategy','Multiplayer'],'developer'=>'Blizzard Entertainment, Inc.','rating'=>4.1,'reviews'=>'4M','installs'=>'50M+','installs_raw'=>50000000,'size'=>'2GB','version'=>'30.6.206674','updated'=>'April 2025','price'=>'Free','offline'=>false,'icon'=>'https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=Hearthstone&background=a855f7&color=fff&size=256','age'=>'13+','category'=>'Card','playstore'=>'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.blizzard.wtcg.hearthstone','trending'=>76,'featured'=>false,'desc'=>'Hearthstone is Blizzard\'s legendary digital collectible card game set in the World of Warcraft universe. Build decks of 30 cards around one of 11 hero classes, each with unique abilities, and duel opponents in strategic real-time card battles. Multiple game modes — Ranked, Arena, Battlegrounds autobattler, and Duels — provide distinct strategic challenges. Regular card set rotations keep the meta dynamic, and expansions introduce mechanics that fundamentally reshape competitive strategies.','editor_review'=>'Hearthstone remains the benchmark of digital CCGs more than a decade after launch. The hero class identity system creates intuitive deckbuilding frameworks, and the Battlegrounds autobattler mode is addictive enough to be a standalone game. The production values are extraordinary — card animations, voice acting, and board interactions are delightfully polished. The game is expensive to keep up with competitively through new expansions, but solo adventures and Battlegrounds require no card collection investment.','how_to_play'=>'Understand tempo — playing cards that are mana-efficient and generate immediate board presence is usually correct. In ranked play, follow established meta decks when learning a class rather than experimenting immediately, as understanding why a deck works requires seeing it succeed first. In Battlegrounds, focus on a single tribe synergy rather than spreading across multiple types. Arena drafting improves dramatically by prioritising cards with high standalone power rather than situational combo pieces.'],

    ['title'=>'Shadow Fight 3','pkg'=>'com.nekki.shadowfight3','genres'=>['Action','RPG'],'developer'=>'Nekki','rating'=>4.4,'reviews'=>'3M','installs'=>'50M+','installs_raw'=>50000000,'size'=>'1.4GB','version'=>'1.38.0','updated'=>'February 2025','price'=>'Free','offline'=>false,'icon'=>'https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=Shadow+Fight+3&background=ef4444&color=fff&size=256','age'=>'12+','category'=>'Action','playstore'=>'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.nekki.shadowfight3','trending'=>74,'featured'=>false,'desc'=>'Shadow Fight 3 is a breathtaking 3D martial arts fighting RPG where you master three combat disciplines across a rich story campaign. The game transitions from stylised shadows to stunning full-colour 3D fighters, each equipped with unique weapons, armour, and special abilities. Choose between Legion, Heralds, and Dynasty fighting styles, each with hundreds of equipment variations that customise both appearance and fighting attributes. Tournament modes and survival challenges test your mastery against increasingly difficult opponents.','editor_review'=>'Shadow Fight 3 is among the most visually impressive fighting games on mobile. The transition from pure shadow aesthetics to vivid 3D with the same graceful animation quality is a stunning achievement. Combat is deeper than it appears — parry timing, stance management, and range control create genuine fighting game complexity. Equipment customisation is satisfying without becoming overwhelming, and the story provides meaningful context to each confrontation. A must-play for fans of martial arts and fighting games.','how_to_play'=>'Learn the timing of your opponent\'s attacks before counterattacking — aggressive rushing leads to significant damage from counters. Shadow Abilities charge through attacking and perfect dodging — save them for situations where normal attacks are being blocked consistently. Equip gear within 30% of your opponent\'s power rating for fair fights. In story mode, adjust difficulty to normal early on to conserve coins for equipment upgrades.'],

    ['title'=>'Archero','pkg'=>'com.habby.archero','genres'=>['Action','RPG','Offline'],'developer'=>'Habby','rating'=>4.4,'reviews'=>'2M','installs'=>'50M+','installs_raw'=>50000000,'size'=>'350MB','version'=>'5.14.0','updated'=>'March 2025','price'=>'Free','offline'=>true,'icon'=>'https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=Archero&background=8b5cf6&color=fff&size=256','age'=>'9+','category'=>'Action','playstore'=>'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.habby.archero','trending'=>77,'featured'=>false,'desc'=>'Archero is a roguelike action game where your archer hero automatically attacks while you control movement to dodge incoming attacks. Each chapter presents increasingly dangerous rooms filled with unique enemies, bouncing projectiles, and explosive hazards. Level up during each run to select powerful abilities from a randomised pool — combining the right skills creates unstoppable synergies. Permanent equipment upgrades carry between runs, gradually increasing survivability as you learn each world\'s mechanics.','editor_review'=>'Archero popularised the auto-attack dodge-em-up genre on mobile and remains one of the best examples of it. The ability selection system creates the satisfying "build" moment unique to roguelikes, where a well-timed ability draw transforms your power level. Movement precision is genuinely important and develops real skill over time. The energy system limits how many runs you can attempt before hitting a cooldown, which prevents both burnout and unlimited free progress — a compromise many players find reasonable.','how_to_play'=>'Never stand still for extended periods — constantly reposition to reset projectile patterns and dodge approaching enemies. Prioritise Abilities in this order: multishot, ricochet, diagonal attacks, and then defensive skills. Stand in corners to benefit from ricochet projectiles bouncing back into enemies. When selecting equipment, focus on upgrading your weapon first as it directly scales your damage output. Bosses have specific attack patterns — learn them to minimise damage taken and maximise damage windows.'],

    ['title'=>'Diablo Immortal','pkg'=>'com.blizzard.diablo.immortal','genres'=>['Action','RPG','Multiplayer'],'developer'=>'Blizzard Entertainment, Inc.','rating'=>4.0,'reviews'=>'2M','installs'=>'10M+','installs_raw'=>10000000,'size'=>'2GB','version'=>'3.2.0','updated'=>'March 2025','price'=>'Free','offline'=>false,'icon'=>'https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=Diablo+Immortal&background=8b5cf6&color=fff&size=256','age'=>'17+','category'=>'Action','playstore'=>'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.blizzard.diablo.immortal','trending'=>76,'featured'=>false,'desc'=>'Diablo Immortal brings the iconic action RPG franchise to mobile as a fully realised massively multiplayer experience set between Diablo II and III. Six character classes — Barbarian, Crusader, Demon Hunter, Monk, Necromancer, and Wizard — each with distinct skill sets battle demonic hordes across Sanctuary. Open-world exploration, dungeon crawls, Rifts, and Elder Rifts provide diverse activities, while world boss encounters and the Cycle of Strife PvP system create competitive challenge.','editor_review'=>'Diablo Immortal offers a legitimately impressive story campaign and one of the most fluid hack-and-slash control schemes on mobile. The moment-to-moment combat feels fantastic — skill animations are impactful and mob destruction is satisfying. The endgame gear system through Legendary Gems is where significant controversy lies, as the power ceiling for non-paying players is substantially lower than heavy spenders. However, the base campaign and early endgame content provides dozens of quality hours without spending.','how_to_play'=>'Complete the main campaign before worrying about endgame progression, as campaign gear keeps you relevant through the story. Choose your class based on preferred play style — Necromancer controls zones, Demon Hunter deals sustained ranged damage, Barbarian is frontline brawler. Join an active clan immediately for Cycle of Strife PvP access and clan events. At max level, prioritise Legendary Gem upgrading for the most significant power gains per resource spent.'],

    ['title'=>'Pokémon UNITE','pkg'=>'jp.pokemon.pokemonunite','genres'=>['Strategy','Multiplayer','Action'],'developer'=>'The Pokémon Company','rating'=>4.2,'reviews'=>'3M','installs'=>'50M+','installs_raw'=>50000000,'size'=>'1.5GB','version'=>'1.15.1','updated'=>'April 2025','price'=>'Free','offline'=>false,'icon'=>'https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=Pokemon+UNITE&background=ef4444&color=fff&size=256','age'=>'9+','category'=>'Strategy','playstore'=>'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=jp.pokemon.pokemonunite','trending'=>82,'featured'=>false,'desc'=>'Pokémon UNITE is the first official Pokémon MOBA, featuring 5v5 team battles across Aeos Island. Battle with iconic Pokémon, score goals in the enemy goal zones, and work with your team to achieve the highest score within the time limit. Over 60 Pokémon are available as playable characters with distinct move sets and item combinations. Ranked Mode, Standard Battle, and limited time Events provide structured competitive and casual play opportunities.','editor_review'=>'Pokémon UNITE successfully translates the MOBA genre for younger audiences and Pokémon fans while retaining enough depth for competitive players. The goal-scoring system creates unique tactical decisions absent from traditional MOBAs — a solo player far ahead can achieve nothing without delivering scores. The familiar Pokémon roster makes each character feel authentic to the source material. The Unite Move mechanic creates exciting momentum-shifting moments in close matches.','how_to_play'=>'Focus on farming wild Pokémon for Aeos Energy early, then score goals when the path is clear rather than engaging in unnecessary fights. Your Pokémon evolves with level — prioritise gaining levels over early contested fights until you reach your power spike evolution stage. Coordinate goal scoring attempts with teammates rather than attempting solo runs. The final two minutes score goals for double points — save high-value scoring runs for this window.'],

    ['title'=>'Words With Friends 2','pkg'=>'com.zynga.wwf2.free','genres'=>['Word','Multiplayer','Puzzle'],'developer'=>'Zynga','rating'=>4.2,'reviews'=>'4M','installs'=>'50M+','installs_raw'=>50000000,'size'=>'130MB','version'=>'18.151','updated'=>'March 2025','price'=>'Free','offline'=>false,'icon'=>'https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=Words+Friends&background=06b6d4&color=fff&size=256','age'=>'13+','category'=>'Word','playstore'=>'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.zynga.wwf2.free','trending'=>68,'featured'=>false,'desc'=>'Words With Friends 2 is the classic asynchronous word game where you challenge friends and strangers to vocabulary battles. Form words on a crossword-style board using letter tiles with different point values, strategically covering premium score squares for multiplied totals. Solo challenges, Lightning Round speed matches, and monthly Team Championships provide variety beyond the core asynchronous format. The matching system finds opponents of similar skill for balanced, competitive matches.','editor_review'=>'Words With Friends 2 remains the definitive asynchronous word game because its formula is simply timeless — vocabulary knowledge combined with board positioning strategy creates a skill depth that rewards both literary knowledge and spatial reasoning. Playing multiple simultaneous games against different opponents creates a satisfying rhythm of turns arriving throughout the day. The social integration with Facebook and phone contacts makes finding regular opponents effortless.','how_to_play'=>'Prioritise scoring on Triple Word Score squares rather than simply playing the longest word possible. Short, high-value words on premium squares consistently outscore long words in open areas. Keep track of remaining letters — knowing that all Q tiles and most vowels are played changes your strategy significantly in late-game positions. Leave your high-value premium squares blocked when ahead rather than risking opponent exploitation of your own setup.'],

    ['title'=>'Chess.com','pkg'=>'com.chess','genres'=>['Strategy','Board','Multiplayer'],'developer'=>'Chess.com','rating'=>4.7,'reviews'=>'3M','installs'=>'50M+','installs_raw'=>50000000,'size'=>'125MB','version'=>'4.7.12','updated'=>'April 2025','price'=>'Free','offline'=>false,'icon'=>'https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=Chess.com&background=6366f1&color=fff&size=256','age'=>'4+','category'=>'Board','playstore'=>'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.chess','trending'=>79,'featured'=>false,'desc'=>'Chess.com brings the world\'s greatest strategy game to Android with multiple game modes, structured learning, and a global community of over 100 million registered players. Play rapid, blitz, bullet, and correspondence games against real opponents matched to your rating. Solve thousands of daily puzzles to sharpen tactical vision, and study with video lessons from grandmasters. Computer analysis breaks down your games move by move, identifying key mistakes and missed opportunities.','editor_review'=>'Chess.com is the essential chess app by an enormous margin. The puzzle system alone has trained millions of players into significantly stronger chess thinkers. The post-game analysis is genuinely enlightening — understanding why you lost is more valuable than simply knowing you did. The rating system is well calibrated and matched games feel competitive at every level from beginner to titled players. Regular tournaments and daily puzzles create excellent daily engagement habits for chess improvement.','how_to_play'=>'Control the centre with pawns and develop knights and bishops before moving the same piece twice. Castle early to protect your king and connect your rooks. In tactical positions, calculate two to three moves ahead before executing a combination. Spend time each day on puzzles rather than purely playing games — tactical improvement from puzzles transfers directly to game performance. Review your losses analytically rather than emotionally.'],

    ['title'=>'Township','pkg'=>'com.playrix.township','genres'=>['Simulation','Strategy','Casual'],'developer'=>'Playrix','rating'=>4.7,'reviews'=>'10M','installs'=>'100M+','installs_raw'=>100000000,'size'=>'440MB','version'=>'22.5.0','updated'=>'April 2025','price'=>'Free','offline'=>false,'icon'=>'https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=Township&background=14b8a6&color=fff&size=256','age'=>'4+','category'=>'Simulation','playstore'=>'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.playrix.township','trending'=>78,'featured'=>false,'desc'=>'Township combines farm simulation with city building in a charming rural-urban hybrid experience. Grow crops, process them into goods through factories, and sell products to develop your town with homes, businesses, and entertainment venues. Explore mines for minerals and artefacts, build a zoo and fill it with rare animals, and serve customers at your airport with their food orders. Township is a remarkably content-rich experience with cooperative Township Regatta events for competitive social players.','editor_review'=>'Township has maintained its enormous player base for years because it genuinely scratches multiple gaming itches simultaneously — farming, city planning, economic management, and social competition. The production chain management has real strategic depth, and the visual reward of watching your town grow from a few crops to a bustling metropolis is consistently satisfying. The Regatta cooperative competition is particularly well designed, creating collaborative objectives that strengthen community bonds within your cooperative group.','how_to_play'=>'Expand your farming fields as early as possible to maximise crop production capacity. Build all factory types early, even if you do not immediately use them, as building upgrades require factories to have been constructed. Participate in Regatta events by completing tasks that match your farm\'s current production capabilities. Reserve Barn expansions using keys found in mines, as storage space becomes the primary limiting factor in mid to late game.'],

    ['title'=>'Honkai: Star Rail','pkg'=>'com.HoYoverse.hkrpgoversea','genres'=>['RPG','Adventure'],'developer'=>'COGNOSPHERE PTE. LTD.','rating'=>4.6,'reviews'=>'2M','installs'=>'10M+','installs_raw'=>10000000,'size'=>'3GB','version'=>'3.2.0','updated'=>'May 2025','price'=>'Free','offline'=>false,'icon'=>'https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=Honkai+Star+Rail&background=8b5cf6&color=fff&size=256','age'=>'12+','category'=>'RPG','playstore'=>'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.HoYoverse.hkrpgoversea','trending'=>97,'featured'=>true,'desc'=>'Honkai: Star Rail is HoYoverse\'s turn-based RPG set across a universe traversed by the Astral Express train. Explore breathtaking space civilisations, form a party of four characters from a diverse cast with elemental typing and path abilities, and engage in strategic turn-based combat with weakness targeting and break mechanics. The story is widely praised as among the best narrative content in mobile gaming, delivering emotional depth through fully voiced cutscenes across multiple substantial story arcs.','editor_review'=>'Honkai: Star Rail is a triumph of turn-based RPG design on mobile. The weakness and break system creates combat depth that rewards understanding enemy compositions and building teams around elemental coverage. The writing quality is exceptional — character arcs, world-building, and dialogue surpass most dedicated narrative games. HoYoverse has been generous with free character distribution, and strategic use of the gacha can yield excellent characters without spending. Among the finest RPG experiences available on any platform.','how_to_play'=>'Build balanced teams with one Harmony support buffer, one sustain character, one path-breaker, and one primary damage dealer. Breaking an enemy\'s toughness bar stuns them and amplifies all damage taken — prioritise targeting weaknesses. Manage Skill Points carefully, saving them for characters who scale heavily on Skill use. Complete Simulated Universe runs weekly for the best free relic progression. Use Dr. Ratio or Acheron for exploration content and your invested main DPS for Memory of Chaos.'],

    ['title'=>'BGMI (Battlegrounds Mobile India)','pkg'=>'com.pubg.imobile','genres'=>['Action','Battle Royale','Multiplayer'],'developer'=>'Krafton, Inc.','rating'=>4.3,'reviews'=>'20M','installs'=>'100M+','installs_raw'=>100000000,'size'=>'850MB','version'=>'3.3.0','updated'=>'April 2025','price'=>'Free','offline'=>false,'icon'=>'https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=BGMI&background=ef4444&color=fff&size=256','age'=>'16+','category'=>'Action','playstore'=>'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.pubg.imobile','trending'=>96,'featured'=>true,'desc'=>'Battlegrounds Mobile India is the official battle royale experience for Indian players, built on the PUBG Mobile engine with India-specific content and cultural events. Drop onto iconic maps — Erangel, Miramar, Livik, and Sanhok — with 99 other players and fight to be the last squad standing. Regular Indian seasonal content featuring Bollywood collaborations, traditional event themes, and esports tournaments make it the most culturally relevant battle royale for Indian mobile gamers.','editor_review'=>'BGMI fills a vital space in the Indian mobile gaming ecosystem with content specifically tailored for local culture and preferences. The PUBG Mobile core is exceptional — gunplay, map design, and squad dynamics are among the best in mobile gaming. Dedicated Indian esports infrastructure around BGMI has created a genuine professional scene with meaningful career paths for talented players. Performance optimisation for the full range of Indian device price points ensures broad accessibility.','how_to_play'=>'Land in hot zones like Pochinki or School if you want early action, quieter zones like the edge of Erangel for slower-paced loot builds. The Gyroscope feature, when mastered, significantly improves horizontal recoil control — practise in training mode. In squad play, designate roles: one IGL calling strategy, one entry fragger, one support player providing heals, and one sniper maintaining long-range pressure. Always close the zone using vehicles, abandoning them before reaching contested final circles.'],

    ['title'=>'Minecraft Earth (Legacy)','pkg'=>'com.mojang.minecraftearth','genres'=>['Simulation','Adventure','Multiplayer'],'developer'=>'Mojang','rating'=>4.0,'reviews'=>'500K','installs'=>'10M+','installs_raw'=>10000000,'size'=>'280MB','version'=>'0.33.0','updated'=>'August 2024','price'=>'Free','offline'=>false,'icon'=>'https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=MC+Earth&background=3b82f6&color=fff&size=256','age'=>'7+','category'=>'Simulation','playstore'=>'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.mojang.minecraftearth','trending'=>58,'featured'=>false,'desc'=>'Minecraft Earth was an augmented reality adventure that placed Minecraft\'s iconic blocky world into the real environment using your phone\'s camera. Collect resources and mobs from the real world around you, build shared Buildplates that friends can contribute to, and engage Mobs in tabletop-scale combat through AR encounters. While the servers are no longer active for live play, the legacy app showcases how AR gaming can combine exploration with creativity in unique ways.','editor_review'=>'Minecraft Earth demonstrated ambitious vision in applying beloved Minecraft mechanics to augmented reality. The build-sharing system created genuine collaborative experiences unique to AR gaming. The combat encounters that placed Minecraft mobs in your living room space were genuinely delightful moments. Its shutdown was a significant loss for AR gaming enthusiasts.','how_to_play'=>'The game servers have been discontinued. The app remains available as a reference but active gameplay is no longer supported online. Offline Buildplate viewing may still function for users who downloaded content while the servers were active.'],

    ['title'=>'Subway Princess Runner','pkg'=>'com.linecorp.LFKR','genres'=>['Arcade','Casual','Offline'],'developer'=>'Ketchapp','rating'=>4.3,'reviews'=>'3M','installs'=>'100M+','installs_raw'=>100000000,'size'=>'80MB','version'=>'7.8.0','updated'=>'February 2025','price'=>'Free','offline'=>true,'icon'=>'https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=Subway+Princess&background=f97316&color=fff&size=256','age'=>'4+','category'=>'Arcade','playstore'=>'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.linecorp.LFKR','trending'=>62,'featured'=>false,'desc'=>'Subway Princess Runner is an endless running adventure featuring a stylish princess sprinting through vibrant city subways and tropical islands. Dodge obstacles, collect coins, and unlock new characters and outfits across diverse world themes. Special missions and daily challenges provide structured goals, while power-ups like magnets and shields extend your runs. The colourful art style and smooth animations create a visually pleasing endless runner experience.','editor_review'=>'Subway Princess Runner does not reinvent the endless runner genre but executes the fundamentals reliably. The character roster offers meaningful visual variety, and world themes create enough environmental diversity to justify extended play. Mission structure prevents aimless running by giving each session a clear purpose. A solid pick-up-and-play choice that fills the same niche as Subway Surfers for players who want a lower-intensity alternative.','how_to_play'=>'Focus on completing mission objectives over raw score — missions earn diamonds significantly faster than pure running. Collect coins consistently to unlock new characters, as some characters have passive bonuses that improve coin collection or power-up duration. Prioritise the Shield power-up in later runs where obstacle density increases. Complete the Challenges board each day for the diamond and coin rewards offered.'],

    ['title'=>'Plants vs. Zombies','pkg'=>'com.ea.game.pvzfree_row','genres'=>['Strategy','Arcade','Offline'],'developer'=>'ELECTRONIC ARTS','rating'=>4.6,'reviews'=>'5M','installs'=>'100M+','installs_raw'=>100000000,'size'=>'70MB','version'=>'3.4.1','updated'=>'November 2024','price'=>'Free','offline'=>true,'icon'=>'https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=PvZ&background=10b981&color=fff&size=256','age'=>'4+','category'=>'Strategy','playstore'=>'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.ea.game.pvzfree_row','trending'=>74,'featured'=>false,'desc'=>'The original Plants vs. Zombies is a timeless tower defence classic featuring an unforgettable cast of plants defending your suburban home against zombie hordes. Place Sunflowers for solar energy, Peashooters and Cabbage-Pults for ranged attacks, Wall-Nuts as barriers, and Cherry Bombs for emergency crowd clearing. Adventure Mode features 50 unique levels across five environments, while Survival Mode and Puzzle Mode extend replayability significantly. Mini-games like Whack-a-Zombie and Beghouled add creative variety.','editor_review'=>'The original Plants vs. Zombies is a masterpiece of game design that deserves its legendary status. The progression of plant unlocks is perfectly paced — each new plant feels like a significant discovery that opens new strategic possibilities. The tone — equal parts charming and absurd — is executed brilliantly through visual design and zombie variety. It remains the definitive version of PopCap\'s vision before sequels introduced monetisation complexity. If you have not played it, do so immediately.','how_to_play'=>'Plant at least three columns of Sunflowers immediately at the back of your lawn before establishing offensive plants. The Potato Mine is exceptional value early in levels as a free temporary defensive barrier. Twin Sunflowers are worth the upgrade cost to reduce solar dependency. Snow Peas in lane one slow all zombies before your main damage plants engage. Keep Cherry Bombs in reserve for football zombie emergencies and large early-level zombie groups.'],

    ['title'=>'Crossy Road','pkg'=>'com.yodo1.crossyroad','genres'=>['Arcade','Casual','Offline'],'developer'=>'Hipster Whale','rating'=>4.3,'reviews'=>'5M','installs'=>'500M+','installs_raw'=>500000000,'size'=>'140MB','version'=>'6.2.0','updated'=>'December 2024','price'=>'Free','offline'=>true,'icon'=>'https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=Crossy+Road&background=f97316&color=fff&size=256','age'=>'4+','category'=>'Arcade','playstore'=>'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.yodo1.crossyroad','trending'=>69,'featured'=>false,'desc'=>'Crossy Road is the endless hopper inspired by Frogger that captured the world\'s imagination with charming pixel art characters and a one-more-tap addictive loop. Hop your character across roads, rivers, and train tracks, timing jumps to avoid cars, trucks, and flooding. Over 150 whimsical characters — from chickens and frogs to famous mascots and themed characters — are available through the prize machine. Each character unlocks a unique world theme with distinct visual style.','editor_review'=>'Crossy Road is the modern Frogger that nobody knew they needed. The voxel art aesthetic is consistently delightful, and the prize machine character unlock system creates a genuine collectible dimension. The sheer variety of themed characters — each changing the game\'s visual theme — makes collecting them all a long-term project. Multiplayer mode adding up to four players simultaneously is chaotic fun that the single-player experience alone cannot replicate.','how_to_play'=>'Time your hops rhythmically with traffic patterns rather than reacting move-by-move. Look ahead two or three hops to plan your routing rather than reacting at the last moment. Use riverside log clusters as temporary resting points to plan safe river crossings. The Eagle appears if you stay stationary for more than five seconds — always keep moving forward. Collect coins consistently as they fund prize machine pulls for new characters.'],

    ['title'=>'Clash of Kings','pkg'=>'com.hcg.cok.gp','genres'=>['Strategy','Multiplayer'],'developer'=>'Elex Technology','rating'=>4.1,'reviews'=>'3M','installs'=>'50M+','installs_raw'=>50000000,'size'=>'420MB','version'=>'10.08.0','updated'=>'February 2025','price'=>'Free','offline'=>false,'icon'=>'https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=Clash+of+Kings&background=6366f1&color=fff&size=256','age'=>'12+','category'=>'Strategy','playstore'=>'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.hcg.cok.gp','trending'=>66,'featured'=>false,'desc'=>'Clash of Kings is a medieval strategy game where you build a castle, raise armies, and compete with millions of players across a persistent world map. Gather resources, research technologies, and forge diplomatic alliances as you expand your territory through conquest and trade. Kingdom Wars pit entire player communities against each other in large-scale battles that can reshape the political landscape of your server for weeks. Choose between seven unique civilisations, each providing different bonuses.','editor_review'=>'Clash of Kings delivers on its promise of epic-scale medieval warfare through its persistent world structure. The moment when a coordinated alliance launches a Kingdom War assault is genuinely thrilling from both an offensive and defensive perspective. Building your castle progressively is satisfying, and the civilisation choice adds meaningful strategic identity. The game demands consistent daily attention and benefits significantly from being in an active, organised alliance.','how_to_play'=>'Join an alliance on Day 1 — solo play leaves you permanently vulnerable to larger opponents. Build resource-generating structures in parallel rather than sequentially. Relocate your castle near alliance members for mutual protection and coordinated attacks. Maintain resource shields during offline periods when your resources are high. In Kingdom Wars, follow your alliance leader\'s rally targets rather than acting independently for maximum effectiveness.'],

    ['title'=>'State of Survival','pkg'=>'com.kingsgroup.sos','genres'=>['Strategy','Simulation'],'developer'=>'FunPlus International AG','rating'=>4.1,'reviews'=>'3M','installs'=>'50M+','installs_raw'=>50000000,'size'=>'900MB','version'=>'1.21.20','updated'=>'March 2025','price'=>'Free','offline'=>false,'icon'=>'https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=State+of+Survival&background=6366f1&color=fff&size=256','age'=>'17+','category'=>'Strategy','playstore'=>'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.kingsgroup.sos','trending'=>71,'featured'=>false,'desc'=>'State of Survival is a strategy survival game set in a zombie apocalypse where you build a settlement, rescue survivors with unique skills, and research technologies to combat the undead threat. The Explorer\'s Trail feature adds a real-time action element where you lead a squad through exploration missions in a direct combat format. Alliance structures and Kill Events create intense player-versus-player competition across the post-apocalyptic world map.','editor_review'=>'State of Survival distinguishes itself from genre competitors with the Explorer\'s Trail action RPG missions that provide direct combat control in a genre typically limited to number management. The survivor collection system creates a roster-building dimension similar to mobile RPGs, and each survivor\'s special skill meaningfully impacts your settlement\'s capabilities. The zombie apocalypse setting adds atmospheric personality to what could otherwise be a generic strategy game.','how_to_play'=>'Prioritise hospital capacity upgrades early to recover troops lost in battles quickly. Join an established alliance rather than creating a new one for immediate access to alliance technologies and help. Keep your HQ shielded during events when enemy activity peaks, typically during Kill Events. In Explorer\'s Trail missions, pair survivors with complementary skills — damage, healing, and crowd control abilities work best in balanced combinations.'],

    ['title'=>'Whiteout Survival','pkg'=>'com.gof.global','genres'=>['Strategy','Simulation'],'developer'=>'Century Games Publishing','rating'=>4.3,'reviews'=>'2M','installs'=>'10M+','installs_raw'=>10000000,'size'=>'1.5GB','version'=>'2.5.1','updated'=>'April 2025','price'=>'Free','offline'=>false,'icon'=>'https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=Whiteout+Survival&background=3b82f6&color=fff&size=256','age'=>'12+','category'=>'Strategy','playstore'=>'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.gof.global','trending'=>82,'featured'=>false,'desc'=>'Whiteout Survival challenges you to build and manage a survival camp in a frozen post-apocalyptic world. Keep your survivors warm by upgrading the Furnace, gather resources before deadly blizzards hit, and manage the happiness and hunger of your population alongside military development. Chief gear and skills create a meaningful RPG progression layer, and state-vs-state wars create large-scale PvP competition between entire server communities.','editor_review'=>'Whiteout Survival brings a genuinely fresh aesthetic to the mobile strategy genre — the frozen landscape and survival themes create atmospheric pressure that generic medieval castle-builders lack. The Furnace mechanic adds a resource management dimension absent from competitors, as failing to maintain warmth has immediate population consequences. The Chief development system creates tangible personal progression alongside the base-building. One of the more innovative strategy games in a crowded genre.','how_to_play'=>'Always keep the Furnace level ahead of your Headquarters level to prevent warming capacity bottlenecks. Build multiple gathering squads from the start to maximise passive resource accumulation. Focus Chief skills on the troop type that matches your most developed barracks. During state wars, coordinate with alliance leadership rather than attacking targets of personal preference — coordinated strikes on a single target are far more effective.'],

    ['title'=>'Plague Inc.','pkg'=>'com.miniclip.plagueinc','genres'=>['Strategy','Simulation','Offline'],'developer'=>'Ndemic Creations','rating'=>4.5,'reviews'=>'2M','installs'=>'50M+','installs_raw'=>50000000,'size'=>'90MB','version'=>'1.19.1','updated'=>'September 2024','price'=>'Free','offline'=>true,'icon'=>'https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=Plague+Inc&background=6366f1&color=fff&size=256','age'=>'12+','category'=>'Strategy','playstore'=>'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.miniclip.plagueinc','trending'=>73,'featured'=>false,'desc'=>'Plague Inc. is the award-winning strategy game where you engineer and evolve a pathogen to infect and eliminate the entire human population before a cure can be developed. Choose from 12 unique plague types — from bacteria and viruses through fungi and parasites to prions and nanobots — each with distinct evolution mechanics. The detailed realistic disease simulation engine models actual infection spread dynamics across 193 countries. Scenario Mode features real historical disease events and custom outbreaks.','editor_review'=>'Plague Inc. is a uniquely compelling strategy experience that transforms epidemiology into tense decision-making. The tension between spreading infection without triggering too much attention and then evolving lethal traits before a cure completes is excellently calibrated. Higher difficulty levels require genuinely clever strategic adaptations. The game gained massive cultural relevance during real-world pandemic awareness, and Ndemic Creations responded by adding Save the World mode — a cooperative spin requiring players to develop cures rather than pathogens.','how_to_play'=>'In bacteria mode, evolve maximum transmission traits before adding any lethality — this allows global spread before medical systems respond. Purchase DNA points from symptom and ability upgrades that align with your current spread region. Prioritise starting in India or China for fastest initial spread due to high population density. Once fully infected globally, begin evolving lethal traits rapidly to overwhelm the cure research. Check which countries are hardest to infect and buy specific resistance abilities targeting those climates.'],

    ['title'=>'Bloons TD 6','pkg'=>'com.ninjakiwi.bloonstd6','genres'=>['Strategy','Simulation','Offline'],'developer'=>'Ninja Kiwi','rating'=>4.7,'reviews'=>'1M','installs'=>'10M+','installs_raw'=>10000000,'size'=>'810MB','version'=>'43.2','updated'=>'April 2025','price'=>'$6.99','offline'=>true,'icon'=>'https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=Bloons+TD6&background=6366f1&color=fff&size=256','age'=>'9+','category'=>'Strategy','playstore'=>'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.ninjakiwi.bloonstd6','trending'=>80,'featured'=>false,'desc'=>'Bloons TD 6 is the definitive tower defence game featuring 55+ monkey towers with three upgrade paths each, 21 maps, and an ever-expanding roster of heroes with powerful active abilities. Stop waves of colourful balloons from reaching the exit by strategically placing and upgrading monkey towers with unique attack capabilities. The depth of tower synergies and upgrade combinations creates virtually unlimited strategic variety. Regular free content updates have expanded the game enormously since launch.','editor_review'=>'Bloons TD 6 is simply the best tower defence game on mobile and arguably in all of gaming. The tower variety is extraordinary — each of the 55+ monkey types has three upgrade paths creating hundreds of distinct power combinations, and hero units add active abilities that reward engagement beyond passive placement. The difficulty range from easy to Impoppable and CHIMPS mode spans a gulf that accommodates beginners and hardcore strategists alike. The premium price is worth every penny.','how_to_play'=>'Place towers on the outside of map corners to maximise coverage of long path sections. Upgrade a primary attack tower to Tier 4 before purchasing additional lower-tier towers — a few powerful towers outperform many weak ones. Heroes should be placed early to gain experience — Obyn and Quincy are excellent starter heroes. On harder modes, prioritise Camo and Lead detection capabilities as MOABs and Camo Bloons bypass most towers without specific upgrades.'],

    ['title'=>'Genies & Gems','pkg'=>'com.scopely.yatzy','genres'=>['Puzzle','Casual'],'developer'=>'Jam City, Inc.','rating'=>4.3,'reviews'=>'2M','installs'=>'50M+','installs_raw'=>50000000,'size'=>'160MB','version'=>'85.98.199','updated'=>'March 2025','price'=>'Free','offline'=>false,'icon'=>'https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=Genies+Gems&background=eab308&color=fff&size=256','age'=>'4+','category'=>'Puzzle','playstore'=>'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.scopely.yatzy','trending'=>62,'featured'=>false,'desc'=>'Genies & Gems is a match-3 adventure game featuring magical genies, enchanted lands, and hundreds of colourful puzzle levels. Match gems to complete objectives, create powerful special gems through combination matches, and unleash genie magic abilities to clear challenging blockages. Journey through diverse magical environments, each with unique visual themes and enemy types that require specific tactical approaches to defeat.','editor_review'=>'Genies & Gems delivers competent match-3 entertainment with a magical theme that differentiates it from the sea of candy and jewel alternatives. The genie ability system creates satisfying moments of powerful board clearing that feel earned rather than random. Level objectives are varied enough to prevent monotony. While it does not revolutionise the genre, it executes the fundamentals reliably with polished visuals and smooth gameplay.','how_to_play'=>'Create special gems by matching four or five in a pattern before clearing ordinary matches. Prioritise eliminating obstacle types blocking your objective items first. Use genie abilities when the board is locked into a difficult configuration rather than immediately after charging them. Team up with friends for life sharing to extend play sessions during challenging stage clusters.'],

    ['title'=>'Candy Crush Soda Saga','pkg'=>'com.king.candycrushsodasaga','genres'=>['Puzzle','Casual','Offline'],'developer'=>'King','rating'=>4.5,'reviews'=>'12M','installs'=>'500M+','installs_raw'=>500000000,'size'=>'85MB','version'=>'1.282.3','updated'=>'April 2025','price'=>'Free','offline'=>true,'icon'=>'https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=CC+Soda&background=eab308&color=fff&size=256','age'=>'3+','category'=>'Puzzle','playstore'=>'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.king.candycrushsodasaga','trending'=>78,'featured'=>false,'desc'=>'Candy Crush Soda Saga fills the board with pink soda and introduces new mechanics that refresh the match-3 formula. Frosting, Honey, and Jam obstacles require specific clearing strategies, while Soda bottles cause the playfield to rise and fall, revealing hidden candy bears needing rescue. New candy combinations — Coloring Candies that transform the board and Fizzy Drinks that swap with adjacent candies — create exciting chain reactions impossible in the original game.','editor_review'=>'Soda Saga successfully differentiates itself from the original Candy Crush through mechanical innovation rather than purely reskinning the concept. The rising soda mechanic changes how you perceive the board strategically, and the new candy types require learning fresh combination logic. For players who have exhausted the original, Soda Saga provides a genuinely distinct challenge while maintaining the familiar satisfaction of well-executed candy matches.','how_to_play'=>'In Soda Mode, prioritise popping soda bottles to raise the level and reach floating bears. Frosting requires two hits to clear — use Wrapped Candy directly on frosted tiles for the most efficient clearing. Coloring Candies combined with Striped Candy clear an entire row in the target colour. Study the objective before making moves — some levels require rescuing bears in a specific order rather than clearing the board indiscriminately.'],

    ['title'=>'Vector: Parkour Run','pkg'=>'com.nekki.vector','genres'=>['Arcade','Action','Offline'],'developer'=>'Nekki','rating'=>4.4,'reviews'=>'3M','installs'=>'100M+','installs_raw'=>100000000,'size'=>'50MB','version'=>'1.7.0','updated'=>'June 2024','price'=>'Free','offline'=>true,'icon'=>'https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=Vector&background=f97316&color=fff&size=256','age'=>'9+','category'=>'Arcade','playstore'=>'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.nekki.vector','trending'=>65,'featured'=>false,'desc'=>'Vector is a shadowy parkour runner inspired by free running culture, featuring a silhouetted hero escaping government pursuit through a dystopian city. Master over 30 parkour moves including flips, vaults, and slides to outmanoeuvre your pursuer across cinematic level designs. Collect stars to unlock new moves that make your runner faster and more agile. The silhouette art style creates a strikingly cinematic aesthetic unique among mobile games.','editor_review'=>'Vector\'s silhouette aesthetic is immediately striking — the contrast between the stark black runner and the detailed city backdrop creates a visual style that remains distinctive years after release. The parkour movement system feels genuinely fluid once mastered, and clearing a level without being caught carries a satisfying sense of speed and grace. The move unlock system provides tangible progression, and the chase dynamic maintains tension throughout each run.','how_to_play'=>'Timing the swipe inputs precisely with on-screen prompts is critical — mistimed moves cost significant speed and allow the pursuer to close the gap. Collect all three stars on initial level attempts by planning your route rather than purely focusing on evasion. Unlock Boost moves first as they provide the greatest speed advantage in tight pursuit situations. The Jump Over move is the most frequently useful — master its timing before attempting advanced combinations.'],

    ['title'=>'Smash Hit','pkg'=>'com.mediocre.smashhit','genres'=>['Arcade','Casual','Offline'],'developer'=>'Mediocre AB','rating'=>4.5,'reviews'=>'4M','installs'=>'100M+','installs_raw'=>100000000,'size'=>'70MB','version'=>'1.5.0','updated'=>'July 2024','price'=>'Free','offline'=>true,'icon'=>'https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=Smash+Hit&background=3b82f6&color=fff&size=256','age'=>'4+','category'=>'Arcade','playstore'=>'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.mediocre.smashhit','trending'=>67,'featured'=>false,'desc'=>'Smash Hit is a hypnotic arcade experience where you hurl steel balls at crystalline obstacles in a surreal procedurally generated journey. Each successful hit shatters obstacles into cascading glass fragments, creating stunning visual spectacles. Miss a shot and you lose balls — run out and the run ends. The ambient electronic soundtrack synchronises beautifully with the destruction, creating an almost meditative state during successful runs. Multiplier bonuses reward consecutive hits and strategic angle play.','editor_review'=>'Smash Hit creates an experience genuinely unlike anything else on mobile. The combination of glass-shattering destruction physics, minimalist surreal environments, and ambient music creates a uniquely trance-like state during extended successful runs. The checkpoint system allows casual players to resume progress, while Premium mode for a small one-time purchase enables checkpoint use. Few games achieve such a distinct and consistently satisfying sensory experience.','how_to_play'=>'Lead moving targets rather than aiming directly at them — throwing slightly ahead of their movement path ensures contact. Multiple balls thrown simultaneously through a single small gap maximise damage to dense obstacle clusters. Hitting large glass panels at their centres shatters them completely with fewer balls than corner hits. Maintain a ball reserve above five at all times — running low forces risky shots that accelerate further loss.'],

    ['title'=>'Monument Valley 2','pkg'=>'com.ustwo.monumentvalley2','genres'=>['Puzzle','Adventure','Offline'],'developer'=>'ustwo games','rating'=>4.7,'reviews'=>'200K','installs'=>'5M+','installs_raw'=>5000000,'size'=>'450MB','version'=>'3.3.10','updated'=>'August 2024','price'=>'$4.99','offline'=>true,'icon'=>'https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=Monument+Valley+2&background=eab308&color=fff&size=256','age'=>'4+','category'=>'Puzzle','playstore'=>'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.ustwo.monumentvalley2','trending'=>72,'featured'=>false,'desc'=>'Monument Valley 2 is the stunning sequel to the award-winning optical illusion puzzle game. Guide a mother and her child through impossible architecture inspired by M.C. Escher, manipulating structures to create pathways through geometric paradoxes. Each of the 14 chapters presents lavishly designed environments that transform perception of space and perspective. The gentle narrative about a parent\'s relationship with a growing child adds emotional depth to the visual experience.','editor_review'=>'Monument Valley 2 is a work of interactive art as much as a game. The visual design is consistently breathtaking — each screenshot could hang in a gallery. The puzzle design achieves the rare balance of being mechanically clever without ever being frustrating, as each solution reveals itself gradually through environmental exploration rather than arbitrary trial and error. The parent-child narrative adds unexpected emotional resonance. Brief but unforgettable at a fair premium price.','how_to_play'=>'Approach each puzzle as an architectural exploration — rotate and manipulate every element before attempting to plan a path. Geometric impossibilities are the key — stairways that connect geometrically impossible locations open when rotated to the correct viewing angle. The mother and child\'s paths are interdependent in some chapters — coordinate their movements thoughtfully rather than moving one character to destination before the other.'],
